<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="REV" style="id">RRK67.SFM Runyankore-Rukiga Bible Version 1964 lasted edited 06.07.2022</book>
  <para style="h">OKUSHUURUURWA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Okushuuruurirwa kwa Yohaana</para>
  <para style="toc2">Okushuuruurirwa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Kush</para>
  <para style="mt1">OKUSHUURUURIRWA</para>
  <para style="mt2">KWA YOHAANA</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="REV 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 1:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 2:28">Dan 2:28</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 2:29">29</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebyashuurwirwe Yesu Kristo, ebi Ruhanga yaamuhaire kworeka abahuuku be ebyabaire nibyenda kubaho juba, nawe akatuma maraika we kubimanyisa omuhuuku we Yohaana, <verse eid="REV 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 1:2" />owaahamize ebi yaareebire byona eby'ekigambo kya Ruhanga n'eby'okuhamya oku Yesu Kristo yaahamize. <verse eid="REV 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 1:3" />Orikushoma ebigambo by'obunabi obu aine omugisha, kandi baine omugisha abarikubihurira, bakata omutima aha bihandiikirwemu; ahabw'okuba obunaku buri haihi.<verse eid="REV 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okweyoreka kwa Yesu ahari Yohaana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 1:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 41:4">Isa 41:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nyowe Yohaana naabahandiikira imwe amakanisa mushanju ag'omuri Asia; nimbendeza embabazi n'obusingye ebirikuruga ahari Ogwo oriho, kandi owaabaire ariho, kandi oribaho, kandi ebirikuruga aha myoyo mushanju eri omu maisho g'ekitebe kye eky'obukama, <verse eid="REV 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 1:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 9:14">Heb 9:14</ref>; <ref loc="REV 19:16">Kush 19:16</ref>. </char></note> kandi ebirikuruga ahari Yesu Kristo kareebi omwesigwa, omujigaijo omu kuzooka, kandi omutegyeki w'abagabe b'ensi. Ogwo otukunda, kandi owaatukomoroire omu bibi byaitu n'eshagama ye, <verse eid="REV 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 1:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 2:9">1 Pet 2:9</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 19:6">Kur 19:6</ref>. </char></note> akatuhindura obukama n'abanyamurwa ahari Ruhanga we kandi Ishe, aheebwe ekitiinisa n'obutegyeki ebiro byona. Amiina. <verse eid="REV 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 1:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 12:10-14">Zek 12:10-14</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:37">Yoh 19:37</ref>. </char></note> Reeba, naija n'ebicu, kandi eriisho ryona riryamureeba, n'abo abaamucumitsire; n'enganda zoona ez'omu nsi ziryaborooga ahabw'okwija kwe. Eego, Amiina.<verse eid="REV 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 1:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 3:14">Kur 3:14</ref>; <ref loc="REV 21:6">Kush 21:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Niinye Alufa na Omega; nikwo Mukama Ruhanga arikugira, oriho, kandi owaabaire ariho, kandi oribaho, Ow'obushoboorozi bwona.<verse eid="REV 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 1:9" />Nyowe Yohaana mwene waanyu, okwataniise naimwe omuri Yesu omu busaasi n'omu bukama n'omu kugumisiriza, nkaba ndi aha kirwa Patumo, ntuzirwe ekigambo kya Ruhanga n'okuhamya ebya Yesu. <verse eid="REV 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 1:10" />Aha izooba rya Mukama nkaba ndi omu Mwoyo, naahurira eiraka rihango nk'ery'enzamba enyima yangye, <verse eid="REV 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 1:11" />nirigira riti: Ebi oraareebe obihandiikye omu kitabo, okyoherereze amakanisa aga mushanju, eya Efeso, Sumuruna, Perugamo, Suatira, Saadi, Filudelafia na Laodikea. <verse eid="REV 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 1:12" />Ahonaaho naahinduka kureeba owaabaire naagamba naanye; ku naahindukire, naareeba ebikondo by'etabaaza mushanju eby'ezaabu, <verse eid="REV 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 1:13" />kandi ahagati y'ebyo bikondo hakaba hariho Orikushusha Omwana w'omuntu, ojwaire ekijwaro ekihikire aha bigyere, kandi ayezirikire orukoba rw'ezaabu omu kifuba; <verse eid="REV 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 1:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:9">Dan 7:9</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 10:6">10:6</ref>. </char></note> omutwe gwe n'eishokye rye bikaba nibyera nk'ebyoya by'entaama, nibyerera kimwe nk'orubaare; amaisho ge gakaba gari nk'endimi z'omuriro, <verse eid="REV 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 1:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 43:2">Ezk 43:2</ref>. </char></note> ebigyere bye bikaba nibyengyengyeta nk'omuringa ogushemereziibwe omu iziiko, kandi eiraka rye rikaba nirihoorera nk'amaizi maingi; <verse eid="REV 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 1:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 5:31">Bar 5:31</ref>. </char></note> omu mukono gwe gwa buryo akwaitsemu enyonyoozi mushanju, omu kanwa ke haarugamu rurara ey'amoogi abiri, kandi ahamaisho ge hakaba nihamurinkana nk'eizooba eririkujwisa amaani.<verse eid="REV 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 1:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 10:8">Dan 10:8</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 10:15">15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku naamureebire, naagwa aha bigyere bye nk'ofiire. Kwonka yantaho omukono gwe gwa buryo naagira ati: Otatiina; niinye w'okubanza kandi ow'aha muheru, mbwenu ohuriire. <verse eid="REV 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 1:18" />Nkaba nfiire, mbwenu ndi ohuriire ebiro byona; kandi nyine ebishumuruzo bya Rufu n'Okuzimu. <verse eid="REV 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 1:19" />Mbwenu handiika ebi waareeba, ebiriho kandi ebiribaho bwanyima. <verse eid="REV 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 1:20" />Amakuru g'enyonyoozi mushanju ezi waareeba omu mukono gwangye gwa buryo, kandi n'ebikondo by'etabaaza mushanju eby'ezaabu, ezo nyonyoozi mushanju nibo baamaraika b'ago makanisa mushanju, kandi ebyo bikondo by'etabaaza mushanju nigo makanisa mushanju.<verse eid="REV 1:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="REV 2" />
  <para style="s1">Ebaruha ezi Yesu yaahandiikiire amakanisa mushanju</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 2:1" />Handiikira maraika w'ekanisa ey'omuri Efeso, oti: Ebi nibyo bigambo by'Ogwo okwaitse enyonyoozi mushanju omu mukono gwe gwa buryo, kandi ogyenda naataayaayira ebikondo by'etabaaza mushanju eby'ezaabu. <verse eid="REV 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 2:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 4:1">1 Yoh 4:1</ref>. </char></note> Ati: Nimmanya ebi orikukora, okwezirika kwawe, n'okugumisiriza kwawe; kandi nimmanya ku otabaasa kugumisiririza abantu babi, kandi ku waayetegyereize abeeyeta entumwa, haza batari bo, okashanga bari ab'ebishuba. <verse eid="REV 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 2:3" />Nimmanya ku ogumisiriza, kandi ku oyemera bingi ahabw'eiziina ryangye, kandi ku otakaruhaga. <verse eid="REV 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 2:4" />Kwonka nyine eki ndikufa naiwe; okareka okukunda kwawe okw'okubanza. <verse eid="REV 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 2:5" />N'ahabw'ekyo oijukye ahu waihire waaza kugwa, oyeteise, ogarukye okore nk'oku waabaire nookora okubanza. Ku oraabe otakozire otyo, ndyaija ahariiwe, nyihe ekikondo ky'etabaaza yaawe omu mwanya gwakyo, ku oriba oteeteisize. <verse eid="REV 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 2:6" />Kwonka eki oine, oyanga ebi Abanikolaiti bakora, naanye ebi nyanga. <verse eid="REV 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 2:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 22:2">Kush 22:2</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 3:24">Kut 3:24</ref>. </char></note> Oine amatu ahurire eki Omwoyo arikugambira amakanisa. Orikusingura ndyamwikiriza kurya aha muti gw'amagara, oguri omuri <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Paradiiso: reeba Luk 23:43. </char></note>Paradiiso ya Ruhanga. <verse eid="REV 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 2:8" />Handiikira maraika w'ekanisa ey'omuri Sumuruna, oti: Ebi nibyo bigambo by'Ow'okubanza kandi Ow'aha muheru, owaabaire afiire, mbwenu ahuriire. <verse eid="REV 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 2:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 11:14">2 Kor 11:14</ref>, <ref loc="2CO 11:15">15</ref>. </char></note> Naagira ati: Nimmanya obusaasi bwawe, n'obworo bwawe (kwonka ori omutungi), kandi nimmanya ngu ojumwa abeeyeta Abayudaaya, haza batari bo, bari sinagogi ya Sitaane. <verse eid="REV 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 2:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 1:12">Dan 1:12</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 1:14">14</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:28">Mat 10:28</ref>. </char></note> Otatiina ebi orikwija kubonabonesibwamu. Reeba, Sitaane naija kuta bamwe omuriimwe omu kihome, ngu mugyezibwe, kandi mumare ebiro ikumi nimubonabonesibwa. Guma ori omwesigwa okuhitsya aha kufa; naanye ndyakuha ekirunga ky'amagara. <verse eid="REV 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 2:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 20:14">Kush 20:14</ref>. </char></note> Oine amatu ahurire eki Omwoyo arikugambira amakanisa. Orikusingura, okufa okwa kabiri tikwine ki kurimwitsa.<verse eid="REV 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 2:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 4:12">Heb 4:12</ref>; <ref loc="REV 19:15">Kush 19:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Handiikira maraika w'ekanisa ey'omuri Perugamo oti: Ebi nibyo bigambo by'Ogwo oine rurara y'amoogi abiri arikugamba, <verse eid="REV 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 2:13" />naagira ati: Nimmanya ahu otuura ku niho ekitebe ky'obukama bwa Sitaane kiba; ku ogumiza kimwe eiziina ryangye, kandi ku otareehakaine ku orikuunyikiriza, nangwa n'omu biro bya Antipa, kareebi wangye omwesigwa, owaitiirwe owaanyu, ahu Sitaane atuura. <verse eid="REV 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 2:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 31:16">Kub 31:16</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka nyine ebigambo bikye ebi ndikufa naiwe; okwo oineyo abarikwikiriza enyegyesa ya Balamu, owaayegyeise Balaki kuta enkongi omu maisho g'Abaisraeli, ngu barye ebitambiirwe ebishushani ebirikuramibwa, kandi bashambane. <verse eid="REV 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 2:15" />Kandi hoona oine n'abandi abarikwikiriza enyegyesa ey'Abanikolaiti. <verse eid="REV 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 2:16" />N'ahabw'ekyo oyeteise; ku oraabe oteeteisize, niinyija kwija juba ahariiwe, mbarwanise na rurara ey'omu kanwa kangye. <verse eid="REV 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 2:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 78:24">Zab 78:24</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 62:2">Isa 62:2</ref>. </char></note> Oine amatu, ahurire eki Omwoyo arikugambira amakanisa. Orikusingura ndyamuha omugabo aha maanu esherekirwe, kandi ndyamuha eibaare eririkwera, erihandiikirweho eiziina risya, eritarikumanywa muntu weena kureka ogwo owaariheebwa.<verse eid="REV 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 2:18" />Handiikira maraika w'ekanisa ey'omuri Suatira, oti: Ebi nibyo bigambo by'Omwana wa Ruhanga, oine amaisho agari nk'endimi z'omuriro, n'ebigyere bye biri nk'omuringa ogurikwengyengyeta. <verse eid="REV 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 2:19" />Naagira ati: Nimmanya emirimo yaawe, n'okukunda kwawe n'okwikiriza n'okuheereza n'okugumisiriza kwawe, kandi nimmanya ngu emirimo yaawe eya bwanyima neekira ey'okubanza. <verse eid="REV 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 2:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 9:22">2 Bag 9:22</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka nyine eki ndikufa naiwe; ogumisiririza omukazi Yezebeeli, orikweyeta nabikazi, kandi oyegyesa abahuuku bangye, akabahabya ngu bashambane, kandi ngu barye ebitambiirwe ebishushani. <verse eid="REV 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 2:21" />Nkamuha omwanya gw'okweteisa; kwonka yaayanga kweteisa obushambani bwe. <verse eid="REV 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 2:22" />Reeba, niinyija kumunaga aha kitabo n'abashambane be omu kubonabona kwingi, ku baraabe bateeteisize by'emicwe ye; <verse eid="REV 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 2:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 62:12">Zab 62:12</ref>. </char></note> kandi n'abaana be ndyabaitsa rufu; amakanisa goona garyamanya ngu niinye ocaaka emitima n'emyoyo; kandi ndyazimuurira omuntu weena omuriimwe ebishemereire ebi yaakozire. <verse eid="REV 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 2:24" />Kwonka imwe ab'omuri Suatira abatsigaire mutaikiriize nyegyesa egyo, abatarikumanya bi abandi beeta enaama za Sitaane, nimbagambira ku ntarikubakorera gundi mutwaro; <verse eid="REV 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 2:25" />kwonka muhamye eki mwine okuhitsya obu ndiija. <verse eid="REV 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 2:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:8">Zab 2:8</ref>. </char></note> Orikusingura, akaguma naakora emirimo yangye okuhitsya aha muheru, ndyamuha obutegyeki aha mahanga goona, <verse eid="REV 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 2:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 12:5">Kush 12:5</ref>. </char></note> kandi aryabategyeka n'enkoni y'ekyoma, nk'oku omuntu ayatagura enyabya z'eibumba, nkaanye oku naahairwe Tata obutegyeki; <verse eid="REV 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="REV 2:28" />kandi ndyamuha Enyonyoozi ey'obusheeshe. <verse eid="REV 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="REV 2:29" />Oine amatu, ahurire ebi Omwoyo arikugambira amakanisa.<verse eid="REV 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="REV 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 3:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 1:16">Kush 1:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Handiikira maraika w'ekanisa y'omuri Saadi, oti: Ebi nibyo bigambo by'Ogwo oine emyoyo mushanju ya Ruhanga, kandi n'ezonyonyoozi mushanju. Naagira ati: Nimmanya ebi okora; oine eiziina ry'okuba ohuriire, kwonka ori ofiire. <verse eid="REV 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 3:2" />Sisiimuka, ogume nooreeba, ogumye ebikiriho ebiri haihi kufa; ahakuba nshangire omuri byona ebi okora hatarimu kihikire omu maisho ga Ruhanga wangye. <verse eid="REV 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 3:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 5:2">1 Tes 5:2</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo oijukye ebi waahairwe kandi n'ebi waahuriire; obihamye, oyeteise. Ahabw'okuba ku oraabe otasisiimukire, okareeba, ndyaija nk'omushuma; torimanya bunaku obu ndikuhikiraho. <verse eid="REV 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 3:4" />Kwonka oine amaziina makye g'abantu b'omuri Saadi, abatarasiisire bijwaro byabo; abo baryagyenda naanye bajwaire ebirikwera, ahakuba babishemereire. <verse eid="REV 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 3:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:32">Kur 32:32</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 32:33">33</ref>; <ref loc="REV 7:9">Kush 7:9</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 4:3">Fil 4:3</ref>. </char></note> Orikusingura aryajwekwa atyo ebijwaro birikwera, kandi tindiiha iziina rye mu kitabo ky'amagara, kureka ndyarihamya omu maisho ga Tata n'omu maisho ga baamaraika be. <verse eid="REV 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 3:6" />Oine amatu, ahurire eki Omwoyo arikugambira amakanisa.<verse eid="REV 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 3:7" />Handiikira maraika w'ekanisa y'omuri Filadelufia oti: Ebi nibyo bigambo by'Ogwo orikwera, ow'amazima, oine ekishumuruzo kya Daudi, oigura hatagire owaakinga, kandi okinga hatagire, owaigura. <verse eid="REV 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 3:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 16:9">1 Kor 16:9</ref>. </char></note> Naagira ati: Nimmanya emirimo yaawe. Reeba, ntaire omu maisho gaawe orwigi orwigwire, oru omuntu weena atarikubaasa kukinga. Nimmanya ngu oine amaani makye, kwonka okeerinda ekigambo kyangye, tiwaayehakana iziina ryangye. <verse eid="REV 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 3:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 43:4">Isa 43:4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 60:14">60:14</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu reeba, naakuha ab'omuri sinagogi ya Sitaane, abeeyeta Abayudaaya, haza batari bo, nibabeiha; ndyabagyema baije bainame omu maisho gaawe, babone kumanya ku naakukunzire. <verse eid="REV 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 3:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 10:36">Heb 10:36</ref>. </char></note> Iwe okarinda ekigambo eki waagambiirwe aha by'okugumisiriza kwangye; naanye nikyo ndikurindira omu bunaku bw'okutegwa okuriija omu nsi yoona, okugyeza boona abagituuramu. <verse eid="REV 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 3:11" />Niinyija juba; gumiza kimwe eki oine, hatagira owaakwaka ekirunga kyawe. <verse eid="REV 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 3:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 2:9">Gal 2:9</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:4">Kush 22:4</ref>. </char></note> Orikusingura ndyamugira enyomyo omuri hekalu ya Ruhanga wangye; nawe tarigirugamu ebiro byona; kandi ndyamuhandiikaho eiziina rya Ruhanga wangye, n'eiziina ry'orurembo rwa Ruhanga wangye, nirwo rurembo Yerusaalemu orusya orurikushuuma okuruga omu iguru ahari Ruhanga wangye, kandi n'eiziina ryangye erisya. <verse eid="REV 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 3:13" />Oine amatu, ahurire eki Omwoyo arikugambira amakanisa.<verse eid="REV 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 3:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 8:22">Enf 8:22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Handiikira maraika w'ekanisa ey'omuri Laodikea, oti: Ebi nibyo bigambo by'Ogwo orikwetwa Amiina, kareebi omwesigwa kandi ow'amazima, obukomooko bw'ebihangirwe bya Ruhanga. <verse eid="REV 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 3:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:11">Rom 12:11</ref>. </char></note> Ati: Nimmanya emirimo yaawe, ku otarikufuka kandi ku otarikwotsya; nangwa kuri noofuka, nari nooyotsya! <verse eid="REV 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 3:16" />Mbwenu ahabw'okutagata kooyakooya, otarikufuka kandi otarikwotsya, niinyija kukutanaka.<verse eid="REV 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 3:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 4:8">1 Kor 4:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Noogira oti: Ndi omutungi, ntungire bingi, tiinyine ki nkyenire; kunu torikumanya ku ori enshoberwa, ow'okusaasirwa, omworo, empumi kandi ojwaire busha. <verse eid="REV 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 3:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 1:7">1 Pet 1:7</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo ninkuhabura ku onguraho ezaabu eshemeziibwe omu muriro obone kuba omutungi, n'ebijwaro ebirikwera obone kujwara, orekye kukwatwa enshoni ahabw'okureebwa ojwaire busha, ogure n'omubazi gw'okuta omu maisho, obone kuhweza. <verse eid="REV 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 3:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 3:12">Enf 3:12</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 12:6">Heb 12:6</ref>. </char></note> Boona abu nkunda mbateisa kandi mbahana; n'ahabw'ekyo oyezirikye, oyeteise.<verse eid="REV 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 3:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 14:23">Yoh 14:23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:36">Luk 12:36</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reeba, nyemereire aha rwigi, nindukongoota niinyiguza; omuntu weena, ku araahurire eiraka ryangye yaanyigurira, niinyija kutaaha omu nju ye, ndye nawe, nawe arye naanye. <verse eid="REV 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 3:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:28">Mat 19:28</ref>. </char></note> Orikusingura, ndyamwikiriza kushutama aha kitebe kyangye ky'obukama, nkaanye oku naasingwire, nkashutama hamwe na Tata aha kitebe ky'obukama bwe. <verse eid="REV 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 3:22" />Oine amatu, ahurire eki Omwoyo arikugambira amakanisa.<verse eid="REV 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="REV 4" />
  <para style="s1">Yohaana okworekwa ekitebe ky'obukama bwa Ruhanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 4:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 19:16">Kur 19:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima y'ebyo, ku naimukize amaisho, naareeba orwigi rwigwire omu iguru, kandi naahurira eiraka eri naabandize kuhurira nk'ery'enzamba, nirigira riti: Inamuka oije kunu, nkworekye ebishemereire kubaho bwanyima. <verse eid="REV 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 4:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:1">Isa 6:1</ref>. </char></note> Ahonaaho naashanga ndi omu Mwoyo, naareeba ekitebe ky'obukama kitairwe omu iguru, naareeba n'Owaabaire akishutamiho; <verse eid="REV 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 4:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:26-28">Ezk 1:26-28</ref>. </char></note> kandi Ogwo owaabaire ashutami akaba naashusha nk'eibaare rya <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">yasipi na sarudi na simaragido na kristalo n'amabaare ag'obuguzi bwingi. </char></note>yasipi n'erya sarudi, kandi ekyo kitebe ky'obukama kikaba kyehinguririziibwe omuhanganzima, ogwabaire nigushusha simaragido. <verse eid="REV 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 4:4" />Kandi kikaba kyehinguririziibwe ebindi bitebe makumi abiri na bina; aha bitebe ebyo hakaba hashutamiho abakuru makumi abiri na bana, bajwaire ebijwaro birikwera n'ebirunga by'ezaabu aha mitwe yaabo. <verse eid="REV 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 4:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:16">Kur 19:16</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 4:2">Zek 4:2</ref>. </char></note> Ahansi y'ekyo kitebe ky'obukama haarugaho emirabyo n'amaraka n'okuhinda kw'enkuba; kandi omu maisho gaakyo haayakamu amatabaaza g'omuriro mushanju, niyo myoyo mushanju eya Ruhanga; <verse eid="REV 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 4:6" />kandi omu maisho g'ekyo kitebe hakaba hariho ekirikushusha nk'enyanja y'endeeberwamu, erikushusha kristalo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 4:6">Okwehinguririza ekyo kitebe embaju zoona, hakaba hariho ebihangirwe ebiine amagara bina, ebiijwire amaisho omu maisho n'enyima. <verse eid="REV 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 4:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 10:14">Ezk 10:14</ref>. </char></note> Ekihangirwe eky'okubanza kikaba nikishusha entare, ekya kabiri nikishusha enimi, ekya kashatu kikaba kiine ahamaisho aharikushusha ah'omuntu, n'ekya kana nikishusha empungu erikuguruka. <verse eid="REV 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 4:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:2">Isa 6:2</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 6:3">3</ref>. </char></note> Ebyo bihangirwe ebina buri kimwe kiine amapapa mukaaga, biijwire amaisho embaju zoona n'omunda; kandi nibyeshongora obutaremura nyomushana na nyekiro, biti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:8">Mukama Ruhanga ow'obushoboorozi bwona</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:8">Owaabaire ariho, oriho, kandi oribaho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:8">Niwe Arikwera, Arikwera, Arikwera.<verse eid="REV 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 4:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 6:26">Dan 6:26</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebihangirwe ebyo ebiine amagara bikiha ekitiinisa Oshutami aha kitebe ky'obukama, kandi oriho ebiro n'ebiro, byamuhimbisa, kandi byamusiima, <verse eid="REV 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 4:10" />abakuru abo makumi abiri na bana bagwa ahansi, bajuumara omu maisho g'Ogwo oriho ebiro n'ebiro, kandi banaga ahansi ebirunga byabo omu maisho g'ekitebe ky'obukama, nibagira bati:<verse eid="REV 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 4:11" />Mukama Ruhanga waitu, oshemereire</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:11">Kuhimbisibwa n'okuheebwa ekitiinisa n'obushoboorozi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:11">Ahabw'okuba niiwe waahangire byona;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:11">Ahabw'okukunda kwawe bikahangwa kandi byabaho.<verse eid="REV 4:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="REV 5" />
  <para style="s1">Okusingura kw'Omwana gw'entaama wa Ruhanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 5:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 2:9">Ezk 2:9</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 2:10">10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi omu mukono gwa buryo gw'Ogwo oshutami aha kitebe ky'obukama naareebamu omuzingo gw'ekitabo ekihandiikirwe omunda n'enyima, kandi kikomirwe n'obumanyiso mushanju. <verse eid="REV 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 5:2" />Bwanyima naareeba maraika w'amaani, naagamba n'eiraka rihango, ati: N'oha oshemereire kushuuruura ekitabo n'okubambuura obumanyiso bwakyo? <verse eid="REV 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 5:3" />Kwonka tihaabaho n'omwe omu iguru n'omu nsi n'obu haakuba ahansi y'ensi, owaabaasa kushuuruura ekyo kitabo, n'obu kwakuba okukireebamu; <verse eid="REV 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 5:4" />naarira munonga ahabw'okutabaho waareebeka ashemereire kushuuruura ekyo kitabo n'okukireebamu. <verse eid="REV 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 5:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 49:9">Kut 49:9</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 11:1">Isa 11:1</ref>. </char></note> Omwe ahari abo bakuru yangira ati: Otarira! Reeba, Entare y'omu ruganda rwa Yuda, ekitsitsa kya Daudi, akasingura; n'ahabw'ekyo naabaasa kushuuruura ekyo kitabo n'okubambuura obumanyiso bwakyo mushanju.<verse eid="REV 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 5:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 53:7">Isa 53:7</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:29">Yoh 1:29</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi ahagati y'ekitebe ky'obukama n'ebihangirwe ebyo ebiine amagara ebina n'abo bakuru, naareebaho Omwana gw'entaama ayemereire, naashusha owaitsirwe, aine amahembe mushanju n'amaisho mushanju, niyo myoyo mushanju ya Ruhanga etumwa omu nsi zoona. <verse eid="REV 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 5:7" />Yaija, yaiha ekitabo omu mukono gwa buryo gw'ogwo oshutami aha kitebe ky'obukama. <verse eid="REV 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 5:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 8:3">Kush 8:3</ref>, <ref loc="REV 8:4">4</ref>. </char></note> Ku yaatwaire ekitabo, ebihangirwe ebyo ebina n'abakuru abo makumi abiri na bana baagwa ahansi, baajuumara omu maisho g'Omwana gw'entaama, buri omwe aine enanga n'orwabya rw'ezaabu orwijwire obubaane bw'omugaju, nibyo by'okushaba by'abarikwera; <verse eid="REV 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 5:9" />baayeshongora ekyeshongoro kisya nibagira bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">Oshemereire kutwara ekitabo n'okubambuura obumanyiso bwakyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">Ahabw'okuba okaitwa, waacungurira Ruhanga abantu n'eshagama yaawe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">Ab'enganda zoona n'endimi zoona n'abantu boona n'amahanga goona,<verse eid="REV 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 5:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 19:6">Kur 19:6</ref>; <ref loc="REV 20:6">Kush 20:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Waabahindura obukama n'abanyamurwa ahari Ruhanga waitu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:10">Kandi baryaba abategyeki omu nsi.<verse eid="REV 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 5:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 7:10">Dan 7:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku naareebire, naahurira amaraka ga baamaraika baingi abeehinguririize ekitebe ky'obukama n'ebihangirwe ebyo ebiine amagara n'abakuru abo; omuhendo gwabo bakaba bari kakumi emirundi kakumi n'enkumi emirundi rukumi, <verse eid="REV 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 5:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:7">Isa 53:7</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 2:8-10">Fil 2:8-10</ref>. </char></note> nibagamba n'eiraka rihango bati: Omwana gw'entaama owaitsirwe ashemereire kuheebwa obushoboorozi n'obutungi n'obwengye n'amaani n'ekitiinisa n'okuhimbisibwa n'omugisha! <verse eid="REV 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 5:13" />Kandi naahurira buri kihangirwe kyona ekiri omu iguru n'omu nsi n'ahansi y'ensi n'omu nyanja n'ebirimu byona, nibigira biti: Oshutami aha kitebe ky'obukama n'Omwana gw'entaama baheebwe omugisha n'ekitiinisa n'okuhimbisibwa n'obushoboorozi ebiro n'ebiro! <verse eid="REV 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 5:14" />Ebihangirwe ebyo ebiine amagara ebina byaikiriza biti: Amiina! N'abakuru abo baagwa ahansi, baaramya.<verse eid="REV 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="REV 6" />
  <para style="s1">Okubambuura obumanyiso mushanju n'ebyakuratsireho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 6:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 5:1">Kush 5:1</ref>, <ref loc="REV 5:2">2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima naareeba Omwana gw'entaama naabambuura akamanyiso kamwe ahari obwo mushanju, naahurira ekihangirwe kimwe ahari ebyo ebiine amagara ebina nikigamba n'eiraka nk'ery'okuhinda kw'enkuba, kiti: Ija! <verse eid="REV 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 6:2" />Ku naimukize amaisho, naareeba embaraasi erikwera, kandi owaabaire agishutamiho akaba aine obuta; yaaheebwa ekirunga, yaagyenda naasingura omu kurwana ngu abone kusingurira kimwe.<verse eid="REV 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 6:3" />Ku yaabambwire akamanyiso ka kabiri, naahurira ekihangirwe ekya kabiri nikigira kiti: Ija! <verse eid="REV 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 6:4" />Haarugayo embaraasi endiijo erikutukura; owaabaire agishutamiho yaikirizibwa kwiha obusingye omu nsi, ngu abantu baitane; kandi yaaheebwa rurara mpango.<verse eid="REV 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 6:5" />Ku yaabambwire akamanyiso ka kashatu, naahurira ekihangirwe ekya kashatu nikigira kiti: Ija! Ku naimukize amaisho, naareeba embaraasi erikwiragura; kandi owaabaire agishutamiho akaba aine eminzaani omu ngaro ze; <verse eid="REV 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 6:6" />naahurira nk'eiraka ahagati y'ebihangirwe ebiine amagara ebina, nirigira riti: Endengo y'engano y'edenaari, n'endengo ishatu za sayiri z'edenaari; kwonka amajuta na viinyo otabishiisha.<verse eid="REV 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 6:7" />Ku yaabambwire akamanyiso ka kana, naahurira eiraka ry'ekihangirwe ekya kana nikigira kiti: Ija! <verse eid="REV 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 6:8" />Ku naimukize amaisho, naareeba embaraasi kisa, n'owaabaire agishutamiho akaba naayetwa Rufu, Okuzimu yaamukuratira, baaheebwa obushoboorozi aha kicweka kimwe kya kana eky'ensi okwitsa abantu rurara n'enjara na rufu n'enyamaishwa mbi z'omu nsi.<verse eid="REV 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 6:9" />Ku yaabambwire akamanyiso ka kataano, naareeba ahansi y'eitambiro emyoyo y'abaitsirwe ahabw'ekigambo kya Ruhanga n'ahabw'obujurizi obu baahaire; <verse eid="REV 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 6:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:43">Bir 32:43</ref>. </char></note> baataka n'eiraka rihango, nibagira bati: Ai bambe, Mukama waitu orikwera kandi ow'amazima, oryahitsya hi okutacwera rubanja abatuura omu nsi n'okubahoora enzigu ahabw'eshagama yaitu? <verse eid="REV 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 6:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:32">Mat 23:32</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima buri omwe yaaheebwa ekijwaro ekirikwera, kandi baaragiirwa kumara ogundi mwanya mukye bahuumwire, okuhitsya omuhendo gw'abaheereza bagyenzi baabo na beene waabo, abarikwija kwitwa nkabo, obu gurihika.<verse eid="REV 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 6:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 13:10">Isa 13:10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25">Luk 21:25</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku yaabambwire akamanyiso aka mukaaga, naareeba omutsitsa mwingi; eizooba ryairagura nk'ekiguniya ky'obwoya oburikwiragura, n'okwezi kwahinduka nk'eshagama, <verse eid="REV 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 6:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 34:4">Isa 34:4</ref>. </char></note> n'enyonyoozi z'ahaiguru zaagwa aha nsi, nk'oku omutiini guragaza ebijuma byagwo bitakahiisize, gwatengyetsibwa omuyaga mwingi; <verse eid="REV 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 6:14" />n'eiguru ryaihwaho nk'oku omuzingo gw'ekitabo guzingwa, kandi enshozi zoona n'ebirwa byona byaihwa omu myanya yaabyo. <verse eid="REV 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 6:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 2:19">Isa 2:19</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 2:21">21</ref>. </char></note> Kandi n'abagabe b'ensi, n'abakungu, n'abakuru b'engabo, n'abatungi, n'ab'obushoboorozi n'abantu boona, abahuuku n'ab'obusingye, baayeshereka omu nyanga n'omu nkiri z'omu nshozi, <verse eid="REV 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 6:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 10:8">Hos 10:8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:30">Luk 23:30</ref>. </char></note> nibatakira enshozi n'enkiri, bati: Mutugwere, mutusherekye amaisho g'Ogwo oshutami aha kitebe ky'obukama, n'ekiniga ky'Omwana gw'entaama; <verse eid="REV 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 6:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 2:11">Yoel 2:11</ref>, <ref loc="JOL 2:31">31</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 3:2">Mal 3:2</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba ekiro kikuru ky'ekiniga kyabo kyahika; n'oha orikubaasa kukyemera?<verse eid="REV 6:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="REV 7" />
  <para style="s1">Omuhendo gw'Abaisraeli abaacungwirwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 7:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 7:2">Dan 7:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima y'ebyo nkareeba baamaraika bana beemereire aha nshonda ina z'ensi, bakingiire emiyaga ena y'ensi, ngu hatagira omuyaga ogwahuuha aha nsi nari aha nyanja n'obu haakuba aha kiti kyona. <verse eid="REV 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 7:2" />Kandi naareeba maraika ondiijo nainamuka naaruga oburugwa-izooba, aine akamanyiso ka Ruhanga ohuriire; yaayeta n'eiraka rihango baamaraika abo abana abaahairwe obushoboorozi kushiisha ensi n'enyanja, <verse eid="REV 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 7:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 9:4">Ezk 9:4</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 9:6">6</ref>. </char></note> naagira ati: Mutashiisha ensi nari enyanja n'obu byakuba ebiti, okuhitsya obu turiheza kuta akamanyiso aha buso bw'abahuuku ba Ruhanga waitu. <verse eid="REV 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 7:4" />Naahurira omubaro gw'abaatairweho akamanyiso, ogwabaire guri akasiriira n'obukumi buna n'enkumi ina, abaarugire omu nganda zoona ez'abaana ba Israeli; <verse eid="REV 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 7:5" />ab'omu ruganda rwa Yuda abaatairweho akamanyiso bakaba bari kakumi n'enkumi ibiri, ab'omu ruganda rwa Reubeeni kakumi n'enkumi ibiri, ab'omu ruganda rwa Gaadi kakumi n'enkumi ibiri, <verse eid="REV 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 7:6" />ab'omu ruganda rwa Asheeri kakumi n'enkumi ibiri, ab'omu ruganda rwa Nafutaali kakumi n'enkumi ibiri, ab'omu ruganda rwa Manaase kakumi n'enkumi ibiri, <verse eid="REV 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 7:7" />ab'omu ruganda rwa Simeoni kakumi n'enkumi ibiri, ab'omu ruganda rwa Leevi kakumi n'enkumi ibiri, ab'omu ruganda rwa Isakaari kakumi n'enkumi ibiri, <verse eid="REV 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 7:8" />ab'omu ruganda rwa Zebuluuni kakumi n'enkumi ibiri, ab'omu ruganda rwa Yosefu kakumi n'enkumi ibiri, n'ab'omu ruganda rwa Benyamiini abaatairweho akamanyiso nabo kakumi n'enkumi ibiri.<verse eid="REV 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abandi abaacungwirwe okuruga omu mahanga agandi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 7:9" />Bwanyima y'ebyo ku naimukize amaisho, naareeba omutwe muhango gw'abantu ogu omuntu atarikubaasa kubara, abaarugire omu mahanga goona n'enganda zoona n'abantu boona n'endimi zoona, beemereire omu maisho g'ekitebe ky'obukama n'omu maisho g'Omwana gw'entaama, bajwaire ebijwaro birikwera, baine amataagi g'enkindo omu ngaro zaabo, <verse eid="REV 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 7:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 12:10">Kush 12:10</ref>. </char></note> nibagamba n'eiraka rihango bati: Okujuna n'okwa Ruhanga waitu, oshutami aha kitebe ky'obukama, kandi n'okw'Omwana gw'entaama. <verse eid="REV 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 7:11" />Kandi baamaraika boona abaabaire beemereire, beehinguririize ekitebe ky'obukama n'abakuru n'ebihangirwe ebiine amagara ebina, baagwa ahansi, baajuumara omu maisho g'ekitebe, baaramya Ruhanga, <verse eid="REV 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 7:12" />nibagira bati: Amiina! Ruhanga waitu aheebwe omugisha n'ekitiinisa n'obwengye n'okusiimwa n'okuhimbisibwa n'obushoboorozi n'amaani ebiro n'ebiro, Amiina.<verse eid="REV 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 7:13" />Kandi omwe aha bakuru abo yambuuza, naagira ati: Aba abajwaire ebijwaro birikwera ni baahi, kandi nibaruga hi? <verse eid="REV 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 7:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:21">Mat 24:21</ref>. </char></note> Naanye naamugarukamu nti: Mukama wangye, niiwe orikumanya. Yangira ati: Aba nibo baarugire omu kubonabona kwingi, bakoozya ebijwaro byabo omu shagama y'Omwana gw'entaama, bikeera. <verse eid="REV 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 7:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 21:3">Kush 21:3</ref>, <ref loc="REV 21:22">22</ref>. </char></note> Nikyo bagumira omu maisho g'ekitebe kya Ruhanga eky'obukama nibamuheereza omuri hekalu ye nyomushana na nyekiro; kandi Ogwo oshutami aha kitebe ky'obukama aryabasangira n'eihema rye. <verse eid="REV 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 7:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 49:10">Isa 49:10</ref>. </char></note> Tibarigira njara bundi, n'obu ryakuba eiriho; tibariitwa mushana, n'obu kyakuba ekibabo kyagwo; <verse eid="REV 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 7:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 23:2">Zab 23:2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 25:8">Isa 25:8</ref>. </char></note> ahabw'okuba Omwana gw'entaama ori aha kitebe ky'obukama aryaba omuriisa waabo; aryabeebembera abahitsye aha nshuro z'amaizi g'amagara; kandi Ruhanga aryaragaza amarira goona aha maisho gaabo.<verse eid="REV 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="REV 8" />
  <para style="s1">Okubambuura akamanyiso ka mushanju, na baamaraika okuteera enzamba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 8:1" />Omwana gw'entaama ku yaabambwire akamanyiso ka mushanju, haabaho akaceceko omu iguru okumara nk'ekicweka ky'eshaaha. <verse eid="REV 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 8:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:31">Mat 24:31</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima naareeba baamaraika mushanju abeemerera omu maisho ga Ruhanga, kandi baaheebwa enzamba mushanju. <verse eid="REV 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 8:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 5:8">Kush 5:8</ref>. </char></note> Haija maraika ondiijo, yaayemerera aha itambiro, aine ekyoterero ky'ezaabu; yaaheebwa obubaane bwingi bw'okwotera eby'okushaba by'abarikwera boona, ngu abyoterere aha itambiro ry'ezaabu omu maisho g'ekitebe ky'obukama; <verse eid="REV 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 8:4" />omwika gw'obubaane gwainamuka n'eby'okushaba by'abarikwera omu maisho ga Ruhanga, niguruga omu mukono gwa maraika. <verse eid="REV 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 8:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:16">Kur 19:16</ref>. </char></note> Maraika yaakwata ekyoterero, yaakiijuza omuriro gw'aha itambiro, yaakinaga aha nsi; haabaho okuhinda n'amaraka n'emirabyo n'omutsitsa.<verse eid="REV 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 8:6" />Baamaraika mushanju, abaabaire baine enzamba mushanju, baayeteekateeka kuziteera.<verse eid="REV 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 8:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOL 2:30">Yoel 2:30</ref>. </char>
    </note> Maraika ow'okubanza yaateera enzamba ye: haabaho orubaare n'omuriro birimu eshagama, byagwa aha nsi; ekicweka kya kashatu eky'ensi kyasya, n'ekicweka kya kashatu ky'ebiti kyasya, n'obunyaatsi bwona obubisi bwasya.<verse eid="REV 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 8:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 51:25">Yer 51:25</ref>. </char>
    </note> Maraika owa kabiri yaateera eye; ekintu ekirikushusha orushozi ruhango orurikwaka omuriro kyanagwa omu nyanja; ekicweka kya kashatu ky'enyanja kyahinduka eshagama; <verse eid="REV 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 8:9" />n'ekicweka kya kashatu ky'ebihangirwe eby'omu nyanja ebiine amagara kyafa; kandi n'ekicweka kya kashatu ky'emeeri zoona kyacwekyerezibwa.<verse eid="REV 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 8:10" />Na maraika owa kashatu yaateera; enyonyoozi mpango, erikwaka nk'orumuri, yaagwa neeruga omu iguru; yaagwa ahari kimwe kya kashatu ky'emigyera n'aha nshuro z'amaizi. <verse eid="REV 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 8:11" />Kandi eiziina ry'enyonyoozi egyo ni <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Apusinto n'ekiti ekirikushaarira nk'omuravunga. </char></note>Apusinto. Ekicweka kya kashatu ky'amaizi kyahinduka omurura; abantu baingi baafa, baitwa amaizi ago, ahakuba gakaba nigashaarira.<verse eid="REV 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 8:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 10:21">Kur 10:21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi maraika owa kana nawe yaateera eye nzamba, ekicweka kya kashatu ky'eizooba n'ekicweka kya kashatu ky'okwezi n'ekicweka kya kashatu ky'enyonyoozi byateerwa; n'ahabw'ekyo ekicweka kya kashatu ky'okwaka kwabyo kyaba omwirima; eizooba ryarereera kwaka ekicweka kya kashatu kya nyomushana, kandi na nyekiro byaba bityo.<verse eid="REV 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 8:13" />Ku naimukize amaisho naareeba eishamba nirizeereera omu mwanya, naahurira nirigamba n'eiraka rihango riti: Ai mbambe! Ai bambe! Abatuura omu nsi baryareeba enaku, ku barihurira amaraka g'enzamba ezi baamaraika abashatu barikwenda kuteera.<verse eid="REV 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="REV 9" />
  <para style="s1">Ekiina ekitaine bugarukiro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 9:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 20:1">Kush 20:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Maraika owa kataano yaateera enzamba, naareba enyonyoozi egwire aha nsi okuruga omu iguru, maraika ogwo yaaheebwa ekishumuruzo ky'ekiina ekitaine bugarukiro; <verse eid="REV 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 9:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:28">Kut 19:28</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 19:18">Kur 19:18</ref>. </char></note> yaigura ekyo kiina ekitaine bugarukiro, kyarugwamu omwika nk'ogw'ekikoomi kihango, eizooba n'akaabunga byaba omwirima ahabw'omwika ogwaruga omuri ekyo kiina. <verse eid="REV 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 9:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 10:12">Kur 10:12</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 10:15">15</ref>. </char></note> Kandi omu mwika ogwo haarugamu enzigye, zaija aha nsi, zaaheebwa obushoboorozi nka <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">skorupio reeba Luk 10:19 </char></note>skorupio ez'omu nsi. <verse eid="REV 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 9:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 9:4">Ezk 9:4</ref>. </char></note> Zaaragiirwa kutashiisha bunyaatsi bw'omu nsi, n'obu kyakuba ekintu kyona ekibisi, nari ekiti kyona, kureka abantu bonka abataine kamanyiso ka Ruhanga aha buso bwabo; <verse eid="REV 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 9:5" />zaikirizibwa kubabonabonesa ameezi ataano, kwonka okutabaitira kimwe; kandi okusaasa kwazo kukaba kuri nk'okwa skorupio yaatonera omuntu. <verse eid="REV 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 9:6" />Omu biro ebyo abantu baryasherura okufa, tibarikubona; baryayetenga rufu, eryabahunga.<verse eid="REV 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 9:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOL 2:4">Yoel 2:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Enzigye ezo zikaba nizishusha nk'embaraasi eziteekateekyeirwe orugamba; aha mitwe yaazo hakaba hariho ebintu ebirikushusha nk'ebirunga by'ezaabu; kandi ahamaisho gaazo hakaba nihashusha aha bantu; <verse eid="REV 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 9:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 1:6">Yoel 1:6</ref>. </char></note> obwoya bwazo bukaba nibushusha eishokye ry'abakazi, n'amaino gaazo nigashusha ag'entare; <verse eid="REV 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 9:9" />ziine eby'okwekingiza aha kifuba ebigumire nk'ebyoma, n'okuhoorera kw'amababa gaazo kukaba kuri nk'okw'ebigaari ebirikukururwa embaraasi ezaasyoka niziza aha rugamba; <verse eid="REV 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 9:10" />ziine emikira n'emburi ez'obushegu nka skorupio, kandi amaani gaazo g'okubonabonesa abantu ameezi ataano gakaba gari omu mikira yaazo; <verse eid="REV 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 9:11" />kandi ziine omukama waazo maraika w'ekiina ekitaine bugarukiro, eiziina rye omu Ruheburaayo ni Abadooni, kandi n'omu Rugriika naayetwa Apolyoni.<verse eid="REV 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Maraika owa mukaaga okuteera enzamba ye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 9:12" />Ekibonaboneso eky'okubanza kyahwa; reeba nihaija kukurataho ebindi bibiri.<verse eid="REV 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 9:13" />Maraika owa mukaaga yaateera enzamba, naahurira eiraka niriruga omu mahembe ana g'eitambiro ry'ezaabu eriri omu maisho ga Ruhanga, <verse eid="REV 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 9:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 16:12">Kush 16:12</ref>. </char></note> nirigambira maraika owa mukaaga owaabaire aine enzamba, riti: Komorora baamaraika bana ababoheirwe aha mugyera Furaati. <verse eid="REV 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 9:15" />Baamaraika abo abana baakomororwa, abaabaire bateekateekyeirwe eshaaha n'ekiro n'okwezi n'omwaka ngu baite ekicweka kya kashatu eky'abantu. <verse eid="REV 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 9:16" />Omubaro gw'abarikurwanira aha mbaraasi gukaba guri kakumi emirundi kakumi emirundi ebiri; naahurira omubaro gwabo. <verse eid="REV 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 9:17" />Oku nikwo naareebire omu kworekwa, nkareeba embaraasi n'abaabaire bazishutamiho. Abo abazishutamiho bakaba bajwaire ebyoma eby'okwekingiza aha kifuba ebirikushusha omuriro na <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">huakinto n'eibaare ery'erangi ya bururu. </char></note>huakinto n'ekibiriiti; n'emitwe y'embaraasi neeshusha ey'entare; omu kanwa kaazo haarugamu omuriro n'omwika n'obuganga bw'ekibiriiti. <verse eid="REV 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 9:18" />Ekicweka kya kashatu ky'abantu kyaitwa ebibonaboneso ebyo byonshatu, omuriro n'omwika n'obuganga bw'ekibiriiti, ebyaruga omu kanwa kaazo. <verse eid="REV 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 9:19" />Ahakuba amaani g'embaraasi gaba omu kanwa kaazo n'omu mikira yaazo; emikira yaazo eshusha enjoka, eine emitwe; kandi niyo zirumisa.<verse eid="REV 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 9:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 2:8">Isa 2:8</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 115:4">Zab 115:4</ref>; <ref loc="REV 16:9">Kush 16:9</ref>, <ref loc="REV 16:11">11</ref>, <ref loc="REV 16:21">21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abantu abaahonokireho bataitsirwe bibonaboneso ebyo, baayanga kweteisa ebi baakozire n'emikono yaabo, n'okurereera kuramya baadaimoni n'ebishushani by'ezaabu n'eby'efeeza n'eby'emiringa n'eby'amabaare n'eby'ebiti, ebitarikubaasa kureeba nari okuhurira, n'obu kwakuba okugyenda, <verse eid="REV 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 9:21" />kandi baayanga n'okweteisa obwitsi bwabo, oburogo bwabo, obushambani bwabo n'obushuma bwabo.<verse eid="REV 9:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="REV 10" />
  <para style="s1">Yohaana okushuuruurirwa omuzingo gw'akatabo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 10:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 5:2">Kush 5:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi nkareeba maraika ondiijo ow'amaani naashuma naaruga omu iguru, ayefubikire ekicu, n'omuhangazima guri ahaiguru y'omutwe gwe; ah'amaisho ge nihaaka nk'eizooba, n'amaguru ge nk'enyomyo z'omuriro. <verse eid="REV 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 10:2" />Akaba aine omuzingo gw'akatabo kashuurwirwe omu ngaro ze. Yaata ekigyere kye kya buryo aha nyanja n'ekya bumosho aha nsi; <verse eid="REV 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 10:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 11:10">Hos 11:10</ref>. </char></note> yaagamba n'eiraka rihango nk'oku entare etsinda; kandi ku yaagambire, ebirikuhinda mushanju byagamba. <verse eid="REV 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 10:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:4">Dan 12:4</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 12:9">9</ref>. </char></note> Ku byaherize kugamba, naayenda kuhandiika; kwonka naahurira eiraka niriruga omu iguru, nirigira riti: koma n'akamanyiso ebyo bigambo ebyagambwa ebirikuhinda mushanju; otabihandiika. <verse eid="REV 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 10:5" />Maraika ogwo, ou naareebire ayemereire aha nyanja n'ahansi; yaimutsya ahaiguru omukono gwe gwa buryo, <verse eid="REV 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 10:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 9:6">Neh 9:6</ref>. </char></note> yaarahira Ogwo obaho ebiro byona, owaahangire eiguru n'ensi n'enyanja n'ebirimu byona, ku hataribaho kutuuraho bundi; <verse eid="REV 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 10:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 3:7">Amo 3:7</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 3:21">Byak 3:21</ref>; <ref loc="REV 11:15">Kush 11:15</ref>. </char></note> kwonka omu biro ebi maraika owa mushanju ariteereramu enzamba ye, enaama ya Ruhanga eryahikiirizibwa, nk'ebigambo ebirungi oku biri ebi yaagambiire <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Omu Rugriika n'abahuuku. </char></note>abaheereza be baanabi.<verse eid="REV 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 10:8" />Eiraka eryo eri naahuriire niriruga omu iguru ryagaruka ryagira riti: Gyenda, otware omuzingo gw'akatabo akashuurwirwe akari omu mukono gwa maraika oyemereire aha nyanja n'ahansi. <verse eid="REV 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 10:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 3:1-3">Ezk 3:1-3</ref>. </char></note> Ntyo naaza ahari maraika, naamugambira kumpa ako katabo; yangarukamu ati: Nkako, katware, okarye, nikaija kunura nk'obwoki omu kanwa kaawe, kwonka omunda yaawe kashaarire. <verse eid="REV 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 10:10" />Nikwo kukaiha omu mukono gwa maraika, nkakarya; omu kanwa kangye kakanura nk'obwoki; kwonka ku naaherize kukarya, omunda kaashaarira. <verse eid="REV 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 10:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 1:10">Yer 1:10</ref>. </char></note> Naagambirwa ku nshemereire kugaruka kuranga eby'abantu b'enganda nyingi, n'amahanga, n'endimi, n'eby'abagabe.<verse eid="REV 10:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="REV 11" />
  <para style="s1">Eby'abajurizi babiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 11:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 40:3">Ezk 40:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima naaheebwa ekibingo ekyemi nk'orubango; omwe yangira ati: Imuka, ogyere hekalu ya Ruhanga n'eitambiro n'abarikugiramizamu; <verse eid="REV 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 11:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 63:18">Isa 63:18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:24">Luk 21:24</ref>; <ref loc="REV 13:5">Kush 13:5</ref>. </char></note> kwonka otagyera ekibuga kyayo; okirekye, ahabw'okuba kikaheebwayo omu mikono y'Abanyamahanga, kandi baryaribatiirira orurembo orurikwera okumara ameezi makumi ana n'abiri. <verse eid="REV 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 11:3" />Kandi abajurizi bangye babiri ndyabaha obushoboorozi bw'okumara ebiro rukumi na magana abiri na makumi mukaaga nibaranga bajwaire ebiguniya.<verse eid="REV 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 11:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ZEC 4:3">Zek 4:3</ref>, <ref loc="ZEC 4:11-14">11-14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abo niyo mizeituuni ebiri, kandi ebikondo by'etabaaza bibiri, abeemerera omu maisho g'Omukama w'ensi yoona. <verse eid="REV 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 11:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 5:14">Yer 5:14</ref>. </char></note> Omuntu weena ku ayenda kubakora kubi, omuriro guruga omu kanwa kaabo, gumaraho abazigu baabo; kandi okwo nikwo omuntu weena orikwenda kubakora kubi, ashemereire kwitwa. <verse eid="REV 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 11:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 17:1">1 Bag 17:1</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 7:17">Kur 7:17</ref>. </char></note> Abo baine obushoboorozi kuzibira eiguru kugwisa enjura omu biro by'okuranga kwabo; kandi baine obushoboorozi okuhindura amaizi eshagama, n'okubonabonesa ensi n'ekibonaboneso kyona, ahu bayendera hoona. <verse eid="REV 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 11:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:21">Dan 7:21</ref>; <ref loc="REV 13:1">Kush 13:1</ref>, <ref loc="REV 13:7">7</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ku bariheza obujurizi bwabo, enyamaishwa eryaruga okuzimu omu kiina ekitaine bugarukiro, ebarwanise, ebasingure, ebaite; <verse eid="REV 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 11:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 1:10">Isa 1:10</ref>. </char></note> n'emitumbi yaabo eryaguma erambiire omu nguuto y'orurembo oruhango, orurikwetwa omu migambire y'omwoyo Sodoma na Misri, ahu Mukama waabo yaabambirwe. <verse eid="REV 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 11:9" />Kandi abantu b'emiringo mingi n'enganda n'endimi n'amahanga baryamara ebiro bishatu n'ekicweka nibashamaarira emitumbi yaabo, tibariikiriza ku eziikwa omu kituuro; <verse eid="REV 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 11:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 105:38">Zab 105:38</ref>. </char></note> n'abatwire omu nsi yoona baryayesiima ahabw'okufa kwabo, bashemererwe; kandi baryatwekyerana ebiconco; ahabw'okuba baanabi abo ababiri bakaba babonabonesa abatuura omu nsi. <verse eid="REV 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 11:11" />Kwonka bwanyima, ebiro ebyo bishatu n'ekicweka bihingwireho, omwitsyo gw'amagara ogurikuruga ahari Ruhanga gwabataahamu, baayemerera; abaabareebire baakwatwa obwoba bwingi; <verse eid="REV 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 11:12" />kandi baahurira eiraka rihango eririkuruga omu iguru niribagira riti: Mwinamukye mwije kunu! Baatemba omu iguru omu kicu, abazigu baabo nibabareeba. <verse eid="REV 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 11:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 38:19">Ezk 38:19</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 38:20">20</ref>. </char></note> Omu shaaha egyo haabaho omutsitsa mwingi, ekicweka kya ikumi ky'orurembo kyagwa; abantu enkumi mushanju baitwa omutsitsa; kandi abaatsigaireho baakwatwa obwoba; baahimbisa Ruhanga ow'omu iguru. <verse eid="REV 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 11:14" />Ekibonaboneso kya kabiri kyahwaho; reeba, ekibonaboneso kya kashatu kiri haihi kwija.<verse eid="REV 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Maraika owa mushanju okuranga oku obukama bwa Ruhanga buriija omu nsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 11:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ZEC 14:9">Zek 14:9</ref>; <ref loc="OBA 1:21">Oba 1:21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Maraika owa mushanju yaateera enzamba; haabaho amaraka mahango omu iguru nigagira gati: Obukama bw'ensi bwahinduka obwa Mukama waitu n'obwa Kristo we, kandi aryaguma aha ngoma ebiro n'ebiro. <verse eid="REV 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 11:16" />Abakuru abo makumi abiri na bana, abashutama aha bitebe byabo omu maisho ga Ruhanga, baagwa, baajuumara, baaramya Ruhanga, <verse eid="REV 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 11:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 41:4">Isa 41:4</ref>. </char></note> nibagira bati: Nitukusiima, Mukama Ruhanga ow'obushoboorozi bwona, oriho kandi owaabaireho, ahakuba otwaire obushoboorozi bwawe obukuru, kandi oyemire, <verse eid="REV 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 11:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 15:1">Kush 15:1</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 2:5">Rom 2:5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 46:6">Zab 46:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 115:13">115:13</ref>. </char></note> Amahanga gakaba gaguubwa kubi, mbwenu ekiniga kyawe kyaija, obunaku bwahika bw'okucwera abafiire orubanja, n'obw'okuha <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Omu Rugriika n'abahuuku. </char></note>abaheereza baawe ebihembo, nibo baanabi n'abarikwera, kandi n'abandi abato n'abakuru abarikutiina eiziina ryawe, n'okuhwerekyereza abahwerekyereza b'ensi. <verse eid="REV 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 11:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 5:7">2 Bus 5:7</ref>; <ref loc="REV 15:5">Kush 15:5</ref>. </char></note> Kandi hekalu ya Ruhanga ey'omu iguru yaigurwa, n'eshanduukye y'endagaano yaareebeka omuri hekalu ye; haabaho emirabyo n'amaraka mahango n'okuhinda n'omutsitsa n'orubaare rwingi.<verse eid="REV 11:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="REV 12" />
  <para style="s1">Eby'omukazi owaazaire omwana, kandi n'eby'ekijoka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 12:1" />Eky'okutangaaza kihango munonga kikareebwa omu iguru, omukazi ajwaire eizooba, n'okwezi kuri ahansi y'ebigyere bye, n'aha mutwe gwe hariho ekirunga ky'enyonyoozi ikumi na ibiri. <verse eid="REV 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 12:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 4:10">Mik 4:10</ref>. </char></note> Omukazi ogwo akaba aine enda; yaarumwa, yaatakibwa ebisha by'okuzaara. <verse eid="REV 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 12:3" />Kandi eky'okutangaaza ekindi kyareebwa omu iguru, ekijoka kihango ekirikutukura, ekiine emitwe mushanju n'amahembe ikumi, kandi kiine ebirunga mushanju aha mitwe yaakyo. <verse eid="REV 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 12:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 8:10">Dan 8:10</ref>. </char></note> Omukira gwakyo gwayeyerera ekicweka kya kashatu ky'enyonyoozi z'omu iguru, gwazinaga aha nsi. Ekyo kijoka kyayemerera omu maisho g'omukazi owaabaire naayenda kuzaara ngu, ku araaheze ati kuzaara, kishonshomere omwana we. <verse eid="REV 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 12:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:9">Zab 2:9</ref>; <ref loc="REV 19:15">Kush 19:15</ref>. </char></note> Yaazaara omwana w'omwojo oritegyekyesa amahanga goona enkoni y'ekyoma; kwonka omwana ogwo yaashahurwa, yaatwarwa ahari Ruhanga n'aha kitebe ky'obukama bwe; <verse eid="REV 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 12:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 11:2">Kush 11:2</ref>, <ref loc="REV 11:3">3</ref>. </char></note> kandi omukazi yaahungira omu ihamba ei Ruhanga yaamuteekateekyeire omwanya, ngu babone kumuriisizayo okumara ebiro rukumi na magana abiri na makumi mukaaga.<verse eid="REV 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Orugamba rwa Mikaeli n'Ekijoka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 12:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 10:13">Dan 10:13</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 10:21">21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Hakabaho orugamba omu iguru, Mikaeli na baamaraika be nibarwanisa ekijoka; kandi ekijoka na baamaraika baakyo baabarwanisa; <verse eid="REV 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 12:8" />baabingwa, kandi okuruga obwo tibaratungire mwanya omu iguru obundi. <verse eid="REV 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 12:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:1">Kut 3:1</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 3:14">14</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:31">Yoh 12:31</ref>. </char></note> Ekijoka ekyo ekihango ekya ira, ekirikwetwa Omuregi kandi Sitaane, orikugobeza ensi yoona, yaanagwa aha nsi hamwe na baamaraika be. <verse eid="REV 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 12:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 1:11">Yob 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31">Luk 22:31</ref>. </char></note> Kandi naahurira eiraka rihango omu iguru nirigira riti: Hati mbwenu okujuna kwa Ruhanga waitu n'amaani ge n'obukama bwe n'obushoboorozi bwa Kristo we biizire, ahakuba omuregi w'ab'eishe-emwe anagirwe ahansi, obarega nyomushana na nyekiro omu maisho ga Ruhanga waitu. <verse eid="REV 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 12:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:37">Rom 8:37</ref>. </char></note> Bakamusingura ahabw'eshagama y'Omwana gw'entaama n'ahabw'ekigambo ky'obujurizi bwabo, nangwa n'okufa bakakwemera. <verse eid="REV 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 12:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 13:5">Kush 13:5</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo, iwe eiguru naimwe abarituuramu,mushoemererwe! Kwonka iwe ensi, naiwe enyanja, muryareeba enaku ahabw'okuba omuregi yaabaizira n'ekiniga kingi, ahakuba naamanya ku aine omwanya mukye.<verse eid="REV 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekijoka okuhiiga omukazi n'oruzaaro rwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 12:13" />Ekijoka ku kyareebire kyanagwa aha nsi, kyahiiga omukazi owaazaire omwana w'omwojo. <verse eid="REV 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 12:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:7">Dan 12:7</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka omukazi yaaheebwa amapapa abiri g'eishamba rihango, ngu agurukye ahungire ekyo kijoka omu ihamba, omu mwanya ogu aririisizibwamu okumara omwanya n'emyanya n'ekicweka ky'omwanya. <verse eid="REV 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 12:15" />Ekijoka kyacwera amaizi agarikwingana omwegyemure enyima y'ogwo mukazi, ngu gamutware; <verse eid="REV 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 12:16" />kwonka ensi yaahwera omukazi, yaayashama, yaamira omwegyemure, ogu ekyo kijoka cyacweire. <verse eid="REV 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 12:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 13:7">Kush 13:7</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 3:15">Kut 3:15</ref>. </char></note> Ekijoka nikwo kugirira ogwo mukazi ekiniga, kikaza kurwanisa oruzaaro rwe orutsigaireho, orurikworobera ebiragiro bya Ruhanga, rukahamya ebya Yesu; kikeemerera aha musheenyi gw'enyanja.<verse eid="REV 12:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="REV 13" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 13:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 17:3">Kush 17:3</ref>, <ref loc="REV 17:9">9</ref>, <ref loc="REV 17:12">12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi naareeba enyamaishwa neetuuhuuka omu nyanja eine amahembe ikumi n'emitwe mushanju; aha mahembe gaayo hariho ebirunga ikumi, n'aha mitwe yaayo hariho eiziina ry'okurogota. <verse eid="REV 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 13:2" />Egyo nyamaishwa ei naareebire ekaba neeshusha engwe, ebiganja byayo nibishusha eby'edubu, n'akanwa kaayo nikashusha ak'entare. Ekijoka kyagiha amaani gaakyo n'ekitebe ky'obukama bwakyo n'obushoboorozi bwingi. <verse eid="REV 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 13:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 17:8">Kush 17:8</ref>. </char></note> Ogumwe aha mitwe yaayo nooshusha oti gukaba gwine obuhuta obw'okugiita; kwonka obuhuta obwo bukakira; ab'ensi yoona baagikurata nibagitangaarira. <verse eid="REV 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 13:4" />Kandi baaramya ekijoka ahabw'okuba kikaha egyo nyamaishwa obushoboorozi bwakyo; baaramya enyamaishwa egyo nibagira bati: N'oha orikushusha enyamaishwa egi? Kandi n'oha owaakubaasa kugirwanisa?<verse eid="REV 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 13:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 7:8">Dan 7:8</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 7:11">11</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 7:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="REV 11:2">Kush 11:2</ref>; <ref loc="REV 12:6">12:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Egyo nyamaishwa yaaheebwa akanwa akarikugamba ebigambo by'amaryo n'eby'okurogota; kandi yaikirizibwa kukoresa obushoboorozi bwayo okumara ameezi makumi ana n'abiri. <verse eid="REV 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 13:6" />Yaayashamya akanwa kaayo, yaagamba eby'okurogota ahari Ruhanga, neerogota aha iziina rye n'aha ihema rye, nibo abatuura omu iguru. <verse eid="REV 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 13:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 11:7">Kush 11:7</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 7:21">Dan 7:21</ref>. </char></note> Kandi yaikirizibwa kurwanisa abarikwera n'okubasingura; yaaheebwa n'obushoboorozi aha nganda zoona n'abantu n'endimi n'amahanga; <verse eid="REV 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 13:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:28">Zab 69:28</ref>; <ref loc="REV 3:5">Kush 3:5</ref>. </char></note> boona abatuura omu nsi baryagiramya, abu amaziina gaabo gatahandiikirwe omu kitabo ky'amagara eky'Omwana gw'entaama owaitsirwe okuruga aha kuhangwa kw'ensi. <verse eid="REV 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 13:9" />Weena oine okutu ahurire. <verse eid="REV 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 13:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 15:2">Yer 15:2</ref>; <ref loc="REV 14:12">Kush 14:12</ref>. </char></note> <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nari: Omuntu weena onyaga aryanyagwa; weena oita na rurara ashemereire kwitwa na rurara. </char></note>Omuntu weena ow'okunyagwa aryanyagwa; weena ow'okwitwa na rurara, ashemereire kwitwa na rurara. Aho niho okugumisiriza n'okwikiriza kw'abarikwera kumanyirwa.<verse eid="REV 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 13:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 7:15">Mat 7:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi naareeba enyamaishwa endiijo neeruga okuzimu omu itaka, eine amahembe abiri nk'ag'omwana gw'entaama, neegamba nk'ekijoka. <verse eid="REV 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 13:12" />Neetegyekyesa obushoboorozi bwona obw'enyamaishwa ey'okubanza omu maisho gaayo, neegyema ensi n'abagituuramu kuramya enyamaishwa ey'okubanza, eyaakizire obuhuta bw'okugiita. <verse eid="REV 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 13:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:24">Mat 24:24</ref>. </char></note> Neekora obumanyiso obukuru, nangwa n'okwiha omuriro omu iguru gukagwa aha nsi omu maisho g'abantu; <verse eid="REV 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 13:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 13:2-4">Bir 13:2-4</ref>. </char></note> ahabw'obumanyiso obwo obu yaahairwe kukorera omu maisho g'egyo nyamaishwa, yaabeihabeiha abatuura omu nsi, ngu bakore ekishushani ahabw'enyamaishwa egyo eyaahutaaziibwe na rurara, ekanga ekagumaho. <verse eid="REV 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 13:15" />Yaikirizibwa kuha ekyo kishushani ky'enyamaishwa omwitsyo, ngu kigambe, kandi kiitise abantu boona abangire kukiramya. <verse eid="REV 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 13:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 19:20">Kush 19:20</ref>. </char></note> Kandi abantu boona, abato n'abakuru, abatungi n'abooro, ab'obusingye n'abahuuku, yaabaragiira kuteebwa akamanyiso aha mukono gwa buryo, nari aha buso, <verse eid="REV 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 13:17" />ngu hatabaho owaagura nari owaatunda, kureka ogwo oine ako kamanyiso, niryo iziina ry'enyamaishwa, nari enamba y'eiziina ryayo. <verse eid="REV 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 13:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 15:2">Kush 15:2</ref>. </char></note> Okukishoborokyerwa nikwetenga obwengye. Orikwetegyereza abare enamba y'enyamaishwa; ahakuba n'enamba y'omuntu; enamba egyo ni magana mukaaga na makumi mukaaga na mukaaga.<verse eid="REV 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="REV 14" />
  <para style="s1">Abacungwirwe okuhimbisa Omwana gw'entaama aha rushozi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 14:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 7:4">Kush 7:4</ref>; <ref loc="REV 3:12">3:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku naimukize amaisho, naareeba Omwana gw'entaama ayemereire aha rushozi Saayuuni hamwe n'abantu akasiriira n'obukumi buna n'enkumi ina, aha buso bwabo hahandiikirweho eiziina rye n'eiziina rya Ishe. <verse eid="REV 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 14:2" />Naahurira eiraka eririkuhoorera nk'amaizi maingi kandi nk'eiraka ery'okuhinda kuhango niriruga omu iguru; kandi eiraka eryo eri naahuriire rikaba riri nk'ery'enanga ezirikuteerwa abateezi baazo; <verse eid="REV 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 14:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 98:1">Zab 98:1</ref>; <ref loc="REV 5:9">Kush 5:9</ref>. </char></note> nibeeshongorera ekyeshongoro kisya omu maisho g'ekitebe ky'obukama n'omu maisho g'ebihangirwe ebiine amagara ebina n'ag'abo bakuru. Kandi tihariho owaabaasize kwega ekyeshongoro ekyo, kureka abo akasiriira n'obukumi buna n'enkumi ina, abaacungwirwe okuruga omu nsi. <verse eid="REV 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 14:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 11:2">2 Kor 11:2</ref>. </char></note> Abo nibo abatareesiisire n'abakazi, ahakuba bakaba nibabyerinda; kandi abo nibo bakuratira Omwana gw'entaama ei aza yoona. Abo bakacungurwa omu bantu okuba omuganuro ahari Ruhanga n'aha Mwana gw'entaama; <verse eid="REV 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 14:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEP 3:13">Zef 3:13</ref>. </char></note> kandi omu kanwa kaabo hakaba hatabamu bishuba, ahakuba bakaba batagira kamogo.<verse eid="REV 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 14:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 8:13">Kush 8:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi naareeba ondiijo maraika naagyendera ahaiguru hagati omu mwanya, aine engiri ey'ebiro n'ebiro okubuurira abatuura omu nsi amahanga goona n'enganda zoona n'endimi n'abantu; <verse eid="REV 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 14:7" />yaagamba n'eiraka rihango ati: Mutiine Ruhanga, mumuhe ekitiinisa, ahakuba obunaku bwe bw'okucweramu orubanja buhikire; muramye Ogwo owaahangire eiguru n'ensi n'enyanja n'enshuro z'amaizi.<verse eid="REV 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 14:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 4:30">Dan 4:30</ref>; <ref loc="REV 18:2">Kush 18:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Haakurataho maraika owa kabiri, naagira ati: Orurembo orukuru Babulooni rugwire, rugwire, orwanyweisize amahanga goona amaarwa g'ekiniga ky'obushambani bwarwo.<verse eid="REV 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 14:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 13:12-17">Kush 13:12-17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Maraika ondiijo owa kashatu yaakurataho, naagamba n'eiraka rihango ati: omuntu weena, orikuramya enyamaishwa n'ekishushani kyayo, akateebwa akamanyiso kaayo aha buso bwe nari aha mukono gwe, <verse eid="REV 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 14:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 75:8">Zab 75:8</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 38:22">Ezk 38:22</ref>. </char></note> ogwo nawe aryanywa aha amaarwa g'ekiniga kya Ruhanga, agaashukirwe omu kikopo ky'okubiihirwa kwe agatafungwire, kandi aryabonabonesibwa n'omuriro n'obuganga bw'ekibiriiti omu maisho ga baamaraika abarikwera n'omu maisho g'Omwana gw'entaama. <verse eid="REV 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 14:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 34:9">Isa 34:9</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 34:10">10</ref>. </char></note> Omwika gw'okubonabonesibwa kwabo gucumbuuka ebiro n'ebiro; abo abaramya enyamaishwa n'ekishushani kyayo, n'omuntu weena oteebwaho akamanyiso k'eiziina ryayo tibahuumura nyomushana na nyekiro. <verse eid="REV 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 14:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 12:17">Kush 12:17</ref>. </char></note> Aho niho okugumisiriza kw'abarikwera kumanyirwa, aboorobera ebiragiro bya Ruhanga, bakaikiriza Yesu.<verse eid="REV 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 14:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 15:58">1 Kor 15:58</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi naahurira eiraka eririkuruga omu iguru niringira riti: Handiika. Okwiha hati baine omugisha abafu abafeera omuri Mukama; eego, nikwo Omwoyo arikugira, ngu babone kuhuumurira kimwe emirabanamu yaabo; ahakuba ebi baakozire bigyenda nabo. <verse eid="REV 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 14:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:39">Mat 13:39</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 13:41">41</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima ku naimukize amaisho, naareeba ekicu kirikwera, kandi aha kicu ekyo hashutamiho orikushusha Omwana w'omuntu ajwaire ekirunga ky'ezaabu aha mutwe, kandi omu ngaro ze ainemu omuhoro gw'obwogi. <verse eid="REV 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 14:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 3:13">Yoel 3:13</ref>. </char></note> Maraika ondiijo yaaruga omuri hekalu, yaagamba n'eiraka rihango, naagira Ogwo owaabaire ashutami aha kicu ati: Kiika omuhoro gwawe oteme, ahabw'okuba obunaku bw'okutema buhikire; kandi eby'okushaaruurwa by'ensi byereire kimwe. <verse eid="REV 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 14:16" />Atyo owaabaire ashutami aha kicu yaanaga omuhoro gwe aha nsi, ensi yaashaaruurwa. <verse eid="REV 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 14:17" />Maraika ondiijo yaaruga omuri hekalu ey'omu iguru, kandi nawe aine omuhoro gw'obwogi. <verse eid="REV 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 14:18" />Na maraika ondiijo, oine obushoboorozi aha muriro, yaaruga aha itambiro, yaagamba n'eiraka rihango, naagira ogwo owaabaire aine omuhoro gw'obwogi ati: Kiika omuhoro gwawe gw'obwogi, ogucwise ebijuma by'omuzaabibu gw'ensi; ahakuba bihiisiize kimwe. <verse eid="REV 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 14:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 19:15">Kush 19:15</ref>. </char></note> Atyo maraika yaanaga omuhoro gwe aha nsi, yaacwa ebijuma by'omuzaabibu gw'ensi, yaabishuka omu inyuukiro rihango ery'ekiniga kya Ruhanga. <verse eid="REV 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 14:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 63:3">Isa 63:3</ref>. </char></note> Byanyuukirwa omu inyuukiryo eryo n'ebigyere aheeru y'orurembo, eshagama yaaruga omu inyuukiro, yaijura okuhika ahaiguru aha nkoba z'embaraasi, kandi ahansi yaahitsya <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Omu kigyero ky'ekigriika, ni stadio rukumi na magana mukaaga. </char></note>mahiro magana abiri.<verse eid="REV 14:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="REV 15" />
  <para style="s1">Enyanja y'endeeberwamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 15:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 11:18">Kush 11:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Naagaruka naareeba omu iguru eky'okureeberaho ekindi, ekikuru kandi eky'okutangaaza, baamaraika mushanju baine ebibonaboneso mushanju eby'aha mperu; ahabw'okuba omuribyo nimwo ekiniga kya Ruhanga kyabaire nikihwera.<verse eid="REV 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 15:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 4:6">Kush 4:6</ref>; <ref loc="REV 5:8">5:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Naareeba ekirikushusha nk'enyanja y'endeeberwamu ejwangize n'omuriro, kandi n'abaatabaarukire omu rugamba rw'enyamaishwa n'ekishushani kyayo n'enamba y'eiziina ryayo basingwire, beemereire aha rubaju rw'egyo nyanja, baine enanga za Ruhanga omu ngaro zaabo. <verse eid="REV 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 15:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 15:1">Kur 15:1</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 15:11">11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 139:14">Zab 139:14</ref>. </char></note> Nibeeshongora ekyeshongoro kya Musa <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Omu Rugriika n'omuhuuku. </char></note>omugaragwa wa Ruhanga, n'ekyeshongoro ky'Omwana gw'entaama nibagira bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">Mukama Ruhanga ow'obushoboorozi bwona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">Ebi waakozire ni bikuru kandi n'eby'okutangaaza;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">Emihanda yaawe ehikiriire kandi n'ey'amazima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">Nyakusinga Mukama w'amahanga.<verse eid="REV 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 15:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAL 1:11">Mal 1:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mukama waitu, n'oha otaritiina, akahimbisa eiziina ryawe?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">Ahakuba niiwe wenka orikwera;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">Amahanga goona garyaija gakuramye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">Ahakuba emitwarize yaawe y'oburyo eyorekirwe.<verse eid="REV 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 15:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 11:19">Kush 11:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima y'ebyo naareeba hekalu ey'eihema ry'obujurizi omu iguru eigwire; <verse eid="REV 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 15:6" />omuri hekalu egyo haarugamu baamaraika mushanju abaabaire baine ebibonaboneso mushanju, bajwaire emyenda mirungi erikwengyengyeta, beezirikire emyeko y'ezaabu omu kifuba. <verse eid="REV 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 15:7" />Kimwe aha bihangirwe ebiine amagara ebina kyaha baamaraika mushanju enyabya z'ezaabu ziijwire ekiniga kya Ruhanga otuuraho ebiro n'ebiro. <verse eid="REV 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 15:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:4">Isa 6:4</ref>. </char></note> Hekalu yaijura omwika ogurikuruga omu kitiinisa kya Ruhanga n'omu bushoboorozi bwe; kandi tihariho muntu weena owaabaasize kutaaha omuri egyo hekalu, ebibonaboneso mushanju bya baamaraika mushanju bitakahwaireyo.<verse eid="REV 15:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="REV 16" />
  <para style="s1">Ebibonaboneso mushanju eby'aha mperu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 16:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ZEP 3:8">Zef 3:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima naahurira eiraka rihango eririkuruga omuri hekalu nirigambira baamaraika mushanju riti: Mugyende, mushukye aha nsi enyabya mushanju z'ekiniga kya Ruhanga.<verse eid="REV 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 16:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 9:10">Kur 9:10</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 9:11">11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Maraika ow'okubanza yaagyenda, yaashuka orwabya rwe aha nsi; abantu abaabaire baine akamanyiso k'egyo nyamaishwa nibaramya ekishushani kyayo baakwatwa ebironda bibi ebirikunuuka.<verse eid="REV 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 16:3" />Maraika owa kabiri yaashuka orwabya rwe omu nyanja, enyanja yaahinduka, yaashusha eshagama y'omufu, kandi ekintu kyona ekihuriire ekyabaire kiri omu nyanja kyafa.<verse eid="REV 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 16:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 78:44">Zab 78:44</ref>. </char>
    </note> Maraika owa kashatu yaashuka orwabya rwe omu migyera n'omu nshuro z'amaizi, byahinduka eshagama. <verse eid="REV 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 16:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:4">Bir 32:4</ref>. </char></note> Naahurira maraika naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 16:5">Iwe Orikwera, oriho, kandi owaabaireho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 16:5">Ori ohikiriire, ahabw'okucwa otyo emanja;<verse eid="REV 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 16:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 49:26">Isa 49:26</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahakuba bakasheesha eshagama y'abarikwera n'eya baanabi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 16:6">Mbwenu obahaire eshagama kuginywa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 16:6">Kandi nikyo kibashemereire.<verse eid="REV 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 16:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 19:2">Kush 19:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi naahurira eitambiro nirigira riti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 16:7">Eego, kibe kityo, Mukama Ruhanga ow'obushoboorozi bwona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 16:7">Emicwere yaawe n'ey'amazima kandi n'ey'oburyo.<verse eid="REV 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 16:8" />Maraika owa kana yaashuka orwabya rwe aha izooba, ryaikirizibwa kubabura abantu n'omuriro; <verse eid="REV 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 16:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 9:20">Kush 9:20</ref>, <ref loc="REV 9:21">21</ref>. </char></note> abantu baayokibwa ekibabo kingi; baajuma eiziina rya Ruhanga, oine obushoboorozi aha bibonaboneso ebyo; tibaayeteisa ngu bamuhe ekitiinisa.<verse eid="REV 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 16:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 10:21">Kur 10:21</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 8:21">Isa 8:21</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 8:22">22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Maraika owa kataano yaashuka orwabya rwe aha kitebe ky'obukama ky'egyo nyamaishwa, obukama bwayo bwashwekwa omwirima; baayeruma endimi ahabw'obusaasi bwingi, <verse eid="REV 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 16:11" />baajuma Ruhanga ow'omu iguru ahabw'okuhururwa n'ahabw'ebironda byabo, kandi nabwo tibaayeteisa bi baakozire.<verse eid="REV 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 16:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 44:27">Isa 44:27</ref>. </char>
    </note> Maraika owa mukaaga yaashuka orwabya rwe aha mugyera muhango, Furaati; amaizi gaagwo gaayoma, ngu omuhanda gushemezibwe ahabw'abagabe abarikuruga oburugwa-izooba. <verse eid="REV 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 16:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 8:3">Kur 8:3</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 22:21-23">1 Bag 22:21-23</ref>. </char></note> Kandi naareeba omu kanwa k'ekijoka n'omu kanwa k'enyamaishwa n'omu kanwa ka nabi ow'ebishuba niharugamu emyoyo mibi eshatu erikushusha ebikyere; <verse eid="REV 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 16:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 19:19">Kush 19:19</ref>. </char></note> niyo myoyo ya baadaimoni erikukora obumanyiso, erikuza oku n'oku omu bagabe b'ensi zoona, okubateeranira hamwe kuza omu rugamba orw'ekiro kikuru kya Ruhanga ow'obushoboorozi bwona. <verse eid="REV 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 16:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 5:2">1 Tes 5:2</ref>. </char></note> (Reeba, niinyija nk'omushuma! Aine omugisha orikuguma naareeba, akarinda ebijwaro bye, ngu arekye kugyenda ajwaire busha, bakareeba enshoni ze.) <verse eid="REV 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 16:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 12:11">Zek 12:11</ref>. </char></note> Emyoyo egyo yaabateeranira omu mwanya ogurikwetwa Haramagedoni omu Ruheburaayo.<verse eid="REV 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 16:17" />Maraika owa mushanju yaashuka orwabya rwe ahaiguru omu mwanya, eiraka rihango ryaruga omuri hekalu aha kitebe ky'obukama, nirigira riti: Kyahwa. <verse eid="REV 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 16:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:1">Dan 12:1</ref>. </char></note> Haabaho emirabyo n'amaraka mahango n'okuhinda n'omutsitsa muhango; omutsitsa muhango kandi ogw'amaani gutyo tigukabahoga okwiha obu abantu baabaho omu nsi. <verse eid="REV 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 16:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 4:30">Dan 4:30</ref>; <ref loc="JER 25:15">Yer 25:15</ref>. </char></note> Orurembo rukuru rwabaganukamu ebicweka bishatu: endembo z'amahanga zaagwa; kandi Ruhanga yaijuka Babulooni, orurembo orukuru, okuruha ekikopo kya viinyo ey'obushaarizi bw'ekiniga kye. <verse eid="REV 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 16:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 6:14">Kush 6:14</ref>. </char></note> Ebirwa byona byahunga, kandi ebibungo byona byabura. <verse eid="REV 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 16:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 9:23">Kur 9:23</ref>. </char></note> Orubaare rwingi rwateera abantu niruruga omu iguru, buri rubaare rwine oburemeezi <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">eraatiri igana omu Rugriika ni etalanta emwe. </char></note>bw'eraatiri igana; abantu baajuma Ruhanga ahabw'ekibonaboneso ky'orubaare orwo; ahakuba kikaba kiri kihango munonga.<verse eid="REV 16:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="REV 17" />
  <para style="s1">Ebya Maraaya n'enyamaishwa erikutukura</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 17:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 51:13">Yer 51:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima omwe ahari baamaraika mushanju abaabaire baine enyabya mushanju yaija, yangira ati: Ija nkworekye orubanja oruricwerwa maraaya omukuru oshutami aha maizi maingi, <verse eid="REV 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 17:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 18:3">Kush 18:3</ref>. </char></note> owaashambaine n'abagabe b'ensi, n'abatuura omu nsi bakasinda viinyo, nibwo bushambani bwe. <verse eid="REV 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 17:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 13:1">Kush 13:1</ref>. </char></note> Yantwara omu ihamba ndi omu Mwoyo, naareeba omukazi ashutami aha nyamaishwa erikutukura, eijwire amaziina g'okurogota, kandi eine emitwe mushanju n'amahembe ikumi. <verse eid="REV 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 17:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 28:13">Ezk 28:13</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 28:16">16</ref>. </char></note> Omukazi ogwo akaba ajwaire emyenda ya bujwa n'erikutukura, ayehunzire eby'ezaabu n'amabaare ag'obuguzi bwingi n'eruuru, aine ekikopo ky'ezaabu omu ngaro ze ekiijwire ebihagaro n'okusiisikara kw'obushambani bwe; <verse eid="REV 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 17:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 14:8">Kush 14:8</ref>. </char></note> kandi aha buso bwe hahandiikirweho eiziina erisherekirwe, BABULOONI ORUREMBO ORUKURU, NYINA WA BAAMARAAYA N'EBIHAGARO BY'ENSI. <verse eid="REV 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 17:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 18:24">Kush 18:24</ref>. </char></note> Naareeba omukazi ogwo asinzire eshagama y'abarikwera n'ey'abaitsirwe ahabwa Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 17:6">Ku naamureebire, naatangaara munonga. <verse eid="REV 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 17:7" />Maraika yambuuza ati: Waatangaazibwa ki? Niinyija kukugambira eky'omubonano ky'ogwo mukazi n'eky'enyamaishwa ei arikugyenderaho, eine emitwe mushanju n'amahembe ikumi. <verse eid="REV 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 17:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:28">Zab 69:28</ref>; <ref loc="REV 13:1-3">Kush 13:1-3</ref>. </char></note> Enyamaishwa ei waareeba ekaba eriho, hati teriho, neeyenda kuruga omu kiina ekitaine bugarukiro, eze omu kuhwerekyerera; kandi abatuura omu nsi, abu amaziina gaabo gatakahandiikwaga mu kitabo ky'amagara okuruga aha kuhangwa kw'ensi, baryatangaara ahabw'okureeba enyamaishwa egyo, ahakuba ekaba eriho, mbwenu teriho, haza kandi n'eija kubaho. <verse eid="REV 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 17:9" />Eki nikyetenga omutima ogwine obwengye. Emitwe mushanju nibwo bubungo mushanju, ahu ogwo mukazi ashutami; <verse eid="REV 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 17:10" />kandi nibo bagabe mushanju; aharibo bataano bakagwa, omwe ariho, ondiijo takaizire; ku ariija, ashemereire kugumaho omwanya mukye. <verse eid="REV 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 17:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 19:20">Kush 19:20</ref>. </char></note> Enyamaishwa eyaabaire eriho, mbwenu etariho, niwe mugabe owa munaana, kwonka n'omwe ahari abo mushanju, kandi nawe naija kuhwerekyerera. <verse eid="REV 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 17:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:20">Dan 7:20</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 7:24">24</ref>. </char></note> Kandi amahembe ikumi agu waareeba n'abagabe ikumi abatakeemire; kwonka nibaija kuheebwa obushoboorozi nk'abagabe okumara eshaaha emwe hamwe n'egyo nyamaishwa. <verse eid="REV 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 17:13" />Abo nibakwatanisa hamwe kuha egyo nyamaishwa amaani gaabo n'obushoboorozi bwabo; <verse eid="REV 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 17:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 2:47">Dan 2:47</ref>; <ref loc="REV 19:16">Kush 19:16</ref>. </char></note> baryarwanisa Omwana gw'entaama, kwonka Omwana gw'entaama aryabasingura, ahakuba ni Mukama w'abakama kandi Omugabe w'abagabe, kandi abo abu aine n'abaayetsirwe, abaatoorainwe kandi abeesigwa.<verse eid="REV 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 17:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 8:7">Isa 8:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yaagaruka yangira ati: Amaizi agu waareeba ahi maraaya ogwo yaaba ashutami, n'abantu b'emiringo mingi n'emitwe mingi n'amahanga n'endimi. <verse eid="REV 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 17:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 18:8">Kush 18:8</ref>. </char></note> Kandi amahembe ikumi agu waareeba hamwe n'enyamaishwa baryayanga maraaya ogwo, atsigare wenka ajwaire busha; baryarya enyama ye, bamwokyeze kimwe n'omuriro; <verse eid="REV 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 17:17" />ahakuba Ruhanga akakita omu mitima yaabo ngu bahikiirize enaama ye, ahabw'okugira omutima gumwe okuha enyamaishwa egyo obushoboorozi bw'okutegyeka obugabe bwabo, okuhitsya obu ebigambo bya Ruhanga birihikiirizibwa. <verse eid="REV 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 17:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 18:10">Kush 18:10</ref>. </char></note> Kandi omukazi ogwo, ou waareeba, nirwo rurembo orukuru orurikutegyeka abagabe b'ensi.<verse eid="REV 17:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="REV 18" />
  <para style="s1">Okucwekyerezibwa kwa Babulooni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 18:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 43:2">Ezk 43:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima y'ebyo naareeba maraika ondiijo naashuuma okuruga omu iguru, aine obushoboorozi bwingi. Ensi yaajwerwa omushana gw'ekitiinisa kye. <verse eid="REV 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 18:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 14:8">Kush 14:8</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 21:9">Isa 21:9</ref>. </char></note> Yaagamba n'eiraka rihango ati: Orurembo orukuru Babulooni rugwire, rugwire! Ruhindukire obutaaho bwa baadaimoni, n'obweshereko bw'emyoyo yoona emibi n'obw'amahungu goona amabi agarikunugwa; <verse eid="REV 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 18:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 51:7">Yer 51:7</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba amahanga goona ganywaire viinyo y'okurigira okubi kw'orurembo orwo, n'abagabe b'ensi bashambaine narwo, kandi n'abashuubuzi b'ensi batungisiibwe ebintu byarwo n'okwegira gye kwarwo okurengyesereize. <verse eid="REV 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 18:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 51:6">Yer 51:6</ref>, <ref loc="JER 51:9">9</ref>, <ref loc="JER 51:45">45</ref>. </char></note> Kandi naahurira eiraka erindi niriruga omu iguru nirigira riti: Mururugyemu, imwe bantu bangye 'mwe, mutakaakwatanisa narwo omu bibi byarwo, mukaheebwa ekifubiro ky'ebirikwija kurubonabonesa; <verse eid="REV 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 18:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:20">Kut 18:20</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 18:21">21</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba ebibi byarwo bituumire byahika ahaiguru munonga, kandi Ruhanga aijukire eby'okushiisha byarwo. <verse eid="REV 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 18:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 137:8">Zab 137:8</ref>; <ref loc="2TH 1:6">2 Tes 1:6</ref>. </char></note> Murugire, nk'oku rwagizire abandi; murwihure kabiri ahabw'ebi rwakozire; omu kikopo eki rwabaijuriizemu ebijwangire, murujwangizemu ebijwangire, murujwangizemu kabiri. <verse eid="REV 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 18:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 50:29">Yer 50:29</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 47:7">Isa 47:7</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 47:8">8</ref>. </char></note> Nk'oku rwayehimbiise, rukarengyesereza omu kwegira gye, mube nikwo mwarwihura okubonabona n'amaganya; ahakuba nirugira omu mutima gwarwo ruti: Nshutami nk'omugabekazi; tindi mufaakazi; tindigira maganya na kakye. <verse eid="REV 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 18:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 50:34">Yer 50:34</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo ebibonaboneso ebyo biryarugwaho omu izooba rimwe, rufu n'amaganya n'enjara, rwokibwe n'omuriro; ahabw'okuba Mukama Ruhanga orikurucwera orubanja n'ow'amaani.<verse eid="REV 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 18:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 26:16">Ezk 26:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abagabe b'ensi abaashambaine narwo n'abaakunire narwo, ku barireeba okucumbuuka kw'omwika gwarwo nirusya, baryarucurira, baruboroogyere; <verse eid="REV 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 18:10" />baryayemerera hangahari ahabw'okutiina okubonabonesibwa kwarwo nibagira bati: Ai bambe! Ai bambe! Babulooni orurembo orukuru orw'amaani! Okucwerwa orubanja kwawe kwaizira omu shaaha emwe.<verse eid="REV 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 18:11" />Abashuubuzi b'ensi nibarira nibarucurira, ahabw'okuba tihakiriho b'okugura eby'obushuubuzi byabo, <verse eid="REV 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 18:12" />eby'ezaabu n'efeeza, amabaare ag'obuguzi bwingi n'eruuru, emyenda emirungi ya kitaani n'eya bujwa n'eya riiri n'erikutukura, ebiti eby'emigaju eby'emiringo yoona, ebintu by'emiino, n'ebintu byona ebibaizirwe omu mbaaho z'obuguzi bwingi, n'eby'emiringa n'eby'ebyoma, n'ebibaizirwe omu ibaare eririkwetwa <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Maruburo, omu kishwahili ni marimari, n'eibaare ery'obuguzi bwingi eririkwengyengyeta, kandi eri bombekyesa. </char></note>maruburo, <verse eid="REV 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 18:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 27:13">Ezk 27:13</ref>. </char></note> omudarasiini n'ebinzaari n'omugaju na <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sumuruna n'omubazi ogurikutuubya obusaasi, ogujwangibwa omu majuta g'okushoroora, ogwomya emitumbi, n'ebindi. </char></note>sumuruna n'obubaane, viinyo n'amajuta n'esaano y'obunono n'engano, ente n'entaama, embaraasi n'ebigaari, n'abahuuku, niyo mibiri y'abantu n'emyoyo yaabo.<verse eid="REV 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 18:14" />Ebyana ebi omutima gwawe gwayetengire bikurugireho, n'ebintu byona ebinuzire, n'ebirungi byawe, bikuhweireho; tibirigaruka kureebwa na kakye. <verse eid="REV 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 18:15" />Abashuubuzi b'ebintu ebyo, abu rwatungiise, baryayemerera hangahari ahabw'okutiina okubonabonesibwa kwarwo nibarira, nibaborooga, nibagira bati: <verse eid="REV 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 18:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 17:4">Kush 17:4</ref>. </char></note> Ai bambe! Ai bambe! Orurembo orukuru orwabaire rujwara emyenda mirungi ya kitaani n'eya bujwa n'erikutukura, rwehunzire eby'ezaabu n'amabaare ag'obuguzi bwingi n'eruuru! <verse eid="REV 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 18:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 27:27-29">Ezk 27:27-29</ref>. </char></note> Omu shaaha emwe obutungi obu bwona bwacwekyerezibwa. Bakama b'emeeri boona, n'abarikuzigyenderamu, abavugi baazo na boona abarikukora omu nyanja, baayemerera hangahari; <verse eid="REV 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 18:18" />baateera enduuru nibareeba omwika gw'okusya kwarwo, nibagira bati: Ebyo harabaireho orurembo orurikwingana n'orurembo oru orukuru! <verse eid="REV 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 18:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 27:30-34">Ezk 27:30-34</ref>. </char></note> Baayeshuka omucuucu omu mitwe, nibarira nibaborooga, nibagira bati: Ai bambe! Ai bambe! Orurembo orukuru, orwatungiise boona abaabaire baine emeeri aha nyanja! Omu shaaha emwe rwacwekyerezibwa. <verse eid="REV 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 18:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:43">Bir 32:43</ref>. </char></note> Murwehimbisizeho, iwe eiguru, naimwe abarikwera n'entumwa na baanabi, ahakuba Ruhanga arucwereire orubanja ahabwanyu.<verse eid="REV 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 18:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 51:63">Yer 51:63</ref>, <ref loc="JER 51:64">64</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima maraika ow'amaani yaiha ahansi eibaare eririkwingana n'orubengo ruhango, yaarirekyera omu nyanja, naagira ati: Oku nikwo orurembo orukuru Babulooni rurinagwa aha nsi n'amaani maingi, kandi tirurireebwa bundi. <verse eid="REV 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 18:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 26:13">Ezk 26:13</ref>. </char></note> Amaraka g'abateezi b'enanga n'abeeshongozi, n'ag'abateezi b'esheegu n'enzamba, tigarigaruka kuhurirwa bundi omuriiwe; n'emengo tizirigaruka kuhurirwa obundi omuriiwe; <verse eid="REV 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 18:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 25:10">Yer 25:10</ref>. </char></note> omuriiwe tiharyakiramu tabaaza obundi; kandi eiraka rya kishwera n'erya kishwerwa tigarigaruka kuhurirwa omuriiwe, ahakuba abashuubuzi baawe bakaba bari bakuru omu nsi, kandi oburogo bwawe bukagobeza amahanga goona. <verse eid="REV 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 18:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:35">Mat 23:35</ref>. </char></note> N'eshagama ya baanabi n'abarikwera n'eya boona abaitsirwe omu nsi ekashangwa omuri orwo rurembo.<verse eid="REV 18:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="REV 19" />
  <para style="s1">Obugyenyi bw'Omwana gw'entaama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 19:1" />Bwanyima y'ebyo naahurira eiraka rihango nk'ery'omutwe muhango gw'abantu omu iguru, nirigira riti: Haleluya! Okujuna n'ekitiinisa n'obushoboorozi n'ebya Ruhanga waitu. <verse eid="REV 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 19:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:43">Bir 32:43</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:10">Kush 6:10</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okuba emanja ezi acwa n'ez'amazima kandi n'ez'oburyo; ahakuba akacwera orubanja maraaya omukuru owaasiisire ensi n'obushambani bwe; kandi yaamuhoora enzigu ahabw'eshagama <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Omu Rugriika n'omuhuuku. </char></note>y'abaheereza be. <verse eid="REV 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 19:3" />Baagaruka baagamba n'eiraka rihango bati: Haleluya! Kandi omwika gwe gwaguma nigucumbuuka ebiro n'ebiro. <verse eid="REV 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 19:4" />Kandi abakuru makumi abiri na bana n'ebihangirwe ebiine amagara ebina baagwa ahansi, baaramya Ruhanga oshutami aha kitebe ky'obukama, nibagira bati: Amiina, Haleluya! <verse eid="REV 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 19:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 115:13">Zab 115:13</ref>. </char></note> Eiraka ryaruga omuri ekyo kitebe ky'obukama, nirigira riti: Musiime Ruhanga waitu, imwe abaheereza be abarikumutiina, abato n'abakuru. <verse eid="REV 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 19:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 11:15">Kush 11:15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 99:1">Zab 99:1</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima naahurira eiraka nk'ery'omutwe muhango gw'abantu eriri nk'eiraka ry'amaizi maingi, kandi nk'ery'okuhinda kw'amaani, nirigira riti: Haleluya! Ahakuba Mukama Ruhanga waitu ow'obushoboorozi bwona ari aha ngoma. <verse eid="REV 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 19:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 21:2">Kush 21:2</ref>, <ref loc="REV 21:9">9</ref>. </char></note> Tushemererwe, tunanukye, tumuhe ekitiinisa; ahakuba obugyenyi bw'Omwana gw'entaama buhikire, kandi Omugore we ayeteekateekire; <verse eid="REV 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 19:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 61:10">Isa 61:10</ref>. </char></note> yaikirizibwa kujwara emyenda mirungi eya kitaani erikwengyengyeta kandi erikwera; egyo myenda ya kitaani nibyo by'okuhikiirira by'abarikwera. <verse eid="REV 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 19:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 14:15">Luk 14:15</ref>. </char></note> Maraika yangira ati: Handiika oti: Baine omugisha abarikwetwa aha bugyenyi bw'Omwana gw'entaama. Kandi yangira ati: Buzimazima ebi n'ebigambo by'amazima ebya Ruhanga. <verse eid="REV 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 19:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:25">Byak 10:25</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 10:26">26</ref>. </char></note> Ahonaaho naagwa ahansi aha bigyere bye kumuramya, yangira ati: Reeba! Otakikora. Ndi omuheereza mugyenzi waawe n'owa beene sho abarikuhamya amazima ga Yesu. Ramya Ruhanga. Ahakuba okuhamya amazima ga Yesu nigwo mwoyo gw'obunabi.<verse eid="REV 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 19:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 96:13">Zab 96:13</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 11:4">Isa 11:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku naimukize amaisho, naareeba iguru rikinguukire n'embaraasi kisa. Ogishutamiho naayetwa Mwesigwa, kandi Mazima. Niwe acwa emanja kandi niwe arwana engamba omu kuhikiirira. <verse eid="REV 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 19:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 1:14">Kush 1:14</ref>. </char></note> Amaisho ge nigashusha nk'endimi z'omuriro; kandi ajwaire ebirunga bingi aha mutwe; aine eiziina erihandiikirwe, eiritarikumanywa muntu weena kureka We wenka. <verse eid="REV 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 19:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:1">Yoh 1:1</ref>. </char></note> Ajwaire ekijwaro ekimiisiirwe eshagama, kandi eiziina rye ni Kigambo kya Ruhanga. <verse eid="REV 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 19:14" />Amahe ag'omu iguru gaamukurata gatembire embaraasi zirikwera, bajwaire emyenda ya kitaani erikwera kandi emirungi munonga. <verse eid="REV 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 19:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 63:3">Isa 63:3</ref>. </char></note> Omu kanwa ke haarugamu rurara y'obwogi ey'okutemesa amahanga; kandi aryabategyekyesa enkoni y'ekyoma, abaribatiirire omu inyuukiro ry'obushaarizi bw'ekiniga kya Ruhanga ow'obushoboorozi bwona; <verse eid="REV 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 19:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 6:15">1 Tim 6:15</ref>. </char></note> kandi aha kijwaro kye n'aha kibero kye hahandiikirweho eiziina eri, Omugabe w'abagabe, kandi Omukama w'abakama.<verse eid="REV 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 19:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 39:17-20">Ezk 39:17-20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima naareeba maraika ondiijo ayemereire omu izooba, yaayeta n'eiraka rihango, naagambira amahungu goona agarikuzereera ahaiguru omu mwanya, ati: Mwije, muteeranire aha bugyenyi bukuru obwa Ruhanga, <verse eid="REV 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 19:18" />murye enyama z'abagabe n'ez'abakuru b'amahe n'ez'amamanzi, ez'embaraasi n'ez'abazigyenderaho n'ez'abantu boona, ab'obusingye n'abahuuku, abato n'abakuru. <verse eid="REV 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 19:19" />Kandi naareeba egyo nyamaishwa n'abagabe b'ensi n'amahe gaabo biteeraniire hamwe kurwanisa Ogwo oshutami aha mbaraasi n'eihe rye. <verse eid="REV 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 19:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 13:11-17">Kush 13:11-17</ref>. </char></note> Enyamaishwa egyo yaakwatwa hamwe na nabi w'ebishuba, owaabaire akora obumanyiso omu maisho gaayo, naabibeihabeihesa abo abaine akamanyiso k'enyamaishwa n'abarikuramya ekishushani kyayo. Abo bombi baanagwa omu nyanja erikwakamu omuriro n'obuganga bw'ekibiriiti bahuriire. <verse eid="REV 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 19:21" />Abaatsigaireho baitwa rurara y'Ogwo oshutami aha mbaraasi, eyaarugire omu kanwa ke; n'amahungu goona gaigutira kimwe enyama z'emitumbi yaabo.<verse eid="REV 19:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="REV 20" />
  <para style="s1">Sitaane okubohwa, n'abarikwera okwema na Yesu emyaka rukumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 20:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2PE 2:4">2 Pet 2:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima naareeba maraika ondiijo naashuuma, naaruga omu iguru aine omu ngaro ekishumuruzo ky'ekiina ekitaine bugarukiro n'orujegyere ruhango. <verse eid="REV 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 20:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:1">Kut 3:1</ref>; <ref loc="REV 12:9">Kush 12:9</ref>. </char></note> Yaakwata ekyo kijoka ekya ira niwe Muregi kandi Sitaane, yaamuboha okumara emyaka rukumi, <verse eid="REV 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 20:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TH 2:9">2 Tes 2:9</ref>, <ref loc="2TH 2:10">10</ref>. </char></note> yaamunaga omu kiina ekitaine bugarukiro, yaakinga, yaataho akamanyiso, ngu arekye kurugamu kubeihabeiha amahanga obundi, okuhitsya ahi emyaka rukumi erihwera. Bwanyima y'egyo myaka ashemereire kubohororwa okumara omwanya mukye.<verse eid="REV 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 20:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 7:27">Dan 7:27</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 6:2">1 Kor 6:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi naareeba ebitebe by'obukama; abaabaire babishutamiho baaheebwa obushoboorozi bw'okucwa emanja. Kandi naareeba emyoyo y'abo abaatemirweho emitwe nibaturwa okuba abajurizi ba Yesu n'ekigambo kya Ruhanga, kandi abatararamize nyamaishwa n'ekishushani kyayo, n'obu kwakuba okwikiriza kuteebwa akamanyiso kaayo aha buso bwabo nari aha mikono yaabo. Baagaruka baaba abahuriire, baayema na Kristo okumara emyaka rukumi. <verse eid="REV 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 20:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 4:16">1 Tes 4:16</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka abafu abandi abaatsigaireho bo tibaragarukire kuba abahuriire, okuhitsya ahi emyaka rukumi yaahwereire. Oku nikwo kuzooka kw'okubanza. <verse eid="REV 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 20:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 61:6">Isa 61:6</ref>. </char></note> Omuntu owaatungire omugabo omu kuzooka okwo okw'okubanza aine omugisha kandi n'orikwera. Abari nk'ogwo okufa kwa kabiri tikubaineho bushoboorozi; kureka baryaba abanyamurwa ba Ruhanga na Kristo, bategyekye nawe okumara emyaka rukumi.<verse eid="REV 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 20:7" />Egyo myaka rukumi ku erihwa, Sitaane aryakomororwa arugye omu kihome, <verse eid="REV 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 20:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 38:16">Ezk 38:16</ref>. </char></note> aryashohora aze kubeihabeiha amahanga agari aha mbaju ina ez'ensi, Googi na Magoogi, okubateerana hamwe kurwana. Obwingi bwabo buryaba nk'omusheenyi ogw'aha rubaju rw'enyanja. <verse eid="REV 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 20:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 1:10">2 Bag 1:10</ref>. </char></note> Baahurura nibareetwa embaju zoona ez'ensi, baayehinguririza orusiisira rw'abarikwera n'orurembo orurikukundwa; kwonka omuriro gwaruga omu iguru, gwabamaraho; <verse eid="REV 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 20:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 19:20">Kush 19:20</ref>. </char></note> na Sitaane, owaababeihabeihire, yaanagwa omu nyanja y'omuriro n'obuganga bw'ekibiriiti, ahu enyamaishwa na nabi ow'ebishuba baabaire bari. Baryabonabonesibwa nyomushana na nyekiro ebiro n'ebiro.<verse eid="REV 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 20:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 25:31-46">Mat 25:31-46</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima naareeba ekitebe ky'obukama kihango ekirikwera n'Ogwo owaabaire akishutamiho; ensi n'eiguru byahunga nibiruga omu maisho ge; byabura obuhamizo. <verse eid="REV 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 20:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 4:3">Fil 4:3</ref>. </char></note> Naareeba abafu, abakuru n'abato, beemereire omu maisho g'ekitebe ky'obukama, ebitabo byashuuruurwa. N'ekitabo ekindi kyashuuruurwa, nikyo eky'amagara. Abafu baacwerwa emanja z'ebyahandiikirwe omu bitabo nk'ebi baakozire oku biri. <verse eid="REV 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 20:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:28">Yoh 5:28</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 5:29">29</ref>. </char></note> Enyanja yaagarura abafu abaabaire bagirimu, na Rufu n'Okuzimu byagarura abafu abaabaire bariyo; boona baacwerwa emanja ez'ebi baakozire. <verse eid="REV 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 20:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:26">1 Kor 15:26</ref>, <ref loc="1CO 15:55">55</ref>. </char></note> Rufu n'Okuzimu byanagwa omu nyanja y'omuriro. Egyo nyanja y'omuriro nikwo kufa okwa kabiri. <verse eid="REV 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 20:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 25:41">Mat 25:41</ref>. </char></note> Kandi omuntu weena, ou eiziina rye ryabaire ritahandiikirwe omu kitabo ky'amagara, yaanagwa omu nyanja y'omuriro.<verse eid="REV 20:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="REV 21" />
  <para style="s1">Eiguru erisya n'ensi ensya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 21:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 65:17">Isa 65:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima naareeba eiguru erisya n'ensi ensya; ahakuba eiguru ery'okubanza n'ensi ey'okubanza bikaba bihweireho, n'enyanja etakiriho. <verse eid="REV 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 21:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:10">Heb 11:10</ref>. </char></note> Kandi naareeba orurembo orurikwera Yerusaleemu orusya, nirushuuma okuruga omu iguru ahari Ruhanga, ruteekateekirwe nk'omugore ocumiirwe iba; <verse eid="REV 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 21:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 2:10">Zek 2:10</ref>. </char></note> naahurira eiraka rihango niriruga omu kitebe ky'obukama nirigira riti: Reeba, eihema rya Ruhanga riri omu bantu. Ruhanga aryatuura nabo; baryaba abantu be, kandi We wenka aryaguma nabo, ari Ruhanga waabo; <verse eid="REV 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 21:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 35:10">Isa 35:10</ref>. </char></note> aryaragaza amarira goona ahamaisho gaabo; tiharibaho kufa bundi, n'obu kwakuba okucura nari okurira nari obusaasi, ahakuba ebya ira biryaba bihweireho.<verse eid="REV 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 21:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CO 5:17">2 Kor 5:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ogwo owaabaire ashutami aha kitebe ky'obukama yaagira ati: Reeba nimpindura byona bisya. Kandi yangira ati: Handiika, ahakuba ebigambo ebi n'eby'okwesigwa kandi eby'amazima. <verse eid="REV 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 21:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 22:17">Kush 22:17</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 55:1">Isa 55:1</ref>. </char></note> Yangira ati: Kyahwa. Niinye Alufa na Omega, obutandikiro n'obugarukiro. Oine eiriho ndyamuhera busha amaizi agarikuruga aha nshuro y'amaizi g'amagara. <verse eid="REV 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 21:7" />Orikusingura aryahungura ebi, ndyaba Ruhanga we, nawe abe omwana wangye. <verse eid="REV 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 21:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 22:15">Kush 22:15</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka abatiini, abatarikwikiriza, abakora ebihagaro, abaitsi, abashambani, abarogi, abaramya ebishushani, n'ababeihi, boona omugabo gwabo guryaba omu nyanja erikwaka omuriro n'obuganga bw'ekibiriiti, nikwo kufa kwa kabiri.<verse eid="REV 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 21:9" />Bwanyima haija omwe ahari baamaraika mushanju abaabaire baine enyabya mushanju eziijwire ebibonaboneso mushanju eby'aha mperu, yangira ati: Ija nkworekye omugore muka Omwana gw'entaama. <verse eid="REV 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 21:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:1">Isa 52:1</ref>. </char></note> Yantwara aha rushozi ruhango kandi ruraingwa ndi omu Mwoyo, yaanyoreka orurembo orurikwera Yerusaalemu, nirushuuma okuruga omu iguru ahari Ruhanga, <verse eid="REV 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 21:11" />rwine ekitiinisa kya Ruhanga; okumurinkana kwarwo nikushusha nk'okw'eibaare ry'obuguzi bwingi, eririkwetwa yasipi, eririkwengyengyeta nka <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kristalo n'eibaare eririkushusha nk'endeeberwamu. </char></note>kristalo. <verse eid="REV 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 21:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 48:31-35">Ezk 48:31-35</ref>. </char></note> Rukaba rwine orugo ruhango kandi ruraingwa n'amarembo ikumi n'abari; aha marembo ago hariho baamaraika ikumi na babiri, kandi hahandiikirweho amaziina g'enganda ikumi na ibiri z'abaana ba Israeli. <verse eid="REV 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 21:13" />Aha rubaju rw'oburugwa-izooba amarembo ashatu, aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho ashatu, aha bukiizi-bwa-buryo ashatu, n'aha rubaju rw'oburengyerwa-izooba amarembo ashatu. <verse eid="REV 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 21:14" />Kandi orugo rw'orwo rurembo rukaba rwine emisingi ikumi n'ebiri, ehandiikirweho amaziina g'entumwa ikumi na ibiri ez'Omwana gw'entaama.<verse eid="REV 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 21:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 40:3">Ezk 40:3</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 40:5">5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ogwo owaagambire naanye akaba aine orubango rw'okugyeresa rw'ezaabu kugyeresa orurembo n'amarembo gaarwo n'orugo rwarwo. <verse eid="REV 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 21:16" />Kandi orurembo rukaingaingana embaju zoona; oburaingwa bwarwo bwingana n'obukiika bwarwo; yaagaruka yaagyera orurembo n'orubango rwe, yaashanga ziri mahiro rukumi na magana ataano; oburaingwa bwarwo n'obukiika bwarwo n'obwemi bwarwo byona nibiingana. <verse eid="REV 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 21:17" />Kandi yaagyera orugo rwarwo, yaashanga rurimu mikono igana na makumi ana n'ena omu migyerere y'abantu, nikyo kimwe n'eya maraika.<verse eid="REV 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 21:18" />Orugo rw'orurembo rukaba rwombekirwe n'amabaare ga yasipi, haza orurembo rwo ruri orw'ezaabu nungi nirwengyengyeta nk'endeeberwamu. <verse eid="REV 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 21:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 54:11">Isa 54:11</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 54:12">12</ref>. </char></note> Emisingi y'orugo rw'orurembo ekaba etonire n'amabaare g'emiringo yoona ag'obuguzi bwingi. Omusingi gw'okubanza gukaba gutonire yasipi, ogwa kabiri safiro, ogwa kashatu kalukedoni, ogwa kana simaragido, <verse eid="REV 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 21:20" />ogwa kataano sarudoniksi, ogwa mukaga sarudio, ogwa mushanju krosoliito, ogwa munaana berulo, ogwa mwenda topazi, ogwa ikumi krusopuraso, ogwa ikumi na gumwe huwakinto, ogwa ikumi n'ebiri amesuusito, <verse eid="REV 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 21:21" />Amarembo ikumi n'abiri n'eruuru ikumi na ibiri, buri irembo rikozirwe n'eruuru emwe, kandi enguuto y'orwo rurembo ekozirwe n'ezaabu nungi erikwengyengyeta nk'endeeberwamu.<verse eid="REV 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 21:22" />Kandi omu rurembo orwo tindareebiremu hekalu, ahakuba Mukama Ruhanga ow'obushoboorozi bwona n'Omwana gw'entaama nibo hekalu yaarwo. <verse eid="REV 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 21:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 60:1-20">Isa 60:1-20</ref>. </char></note> Orurembo orwo tirwetenga izooba nari okwezi kurwakira, ahakuba ekitiinisa kya Ruhanga nigwo mushana gwarwo, kandi Omwana gw'entaama niwe tabaaza yaarwo. <verse eid="REV 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 21:24" />Amahanga garyagyendera omu mushana gwarwo, n'abagabe b'ensi baryarureetamu ekitiinisa kyabo; <verse eid="REV 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 21:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 22:5">Kush 22:5</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 14:7">Zek 14:7</ref>. </char></note> amarembo gaarwo tigarikingwa nyomushana, kandi tiharibayo kiro. <verse eid="REV 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 21:26" />Baryarureetamu ekitiinisa ky'amahanga n'okuhimbisibwa kwago. <verse eid="REV 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 21:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:1">Isa 52:1</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka tiharitaahamu kintu kyona ekitashemeire, n'obu yaakuba weena okora ebihagaro nari omubeihi, kureka abo bonka abahandiikirwe omu kitabo ky'amagara eky'Omwana gw'entaama.<verse eid="REV 21:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="REV 22" />
  <para style="s1">Omugyera gw'amaizi g'amagara.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 22:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 47:1">Ezk 47:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima yaanyoreka omugyera gw'amaizi g'amagara, agarikwengyengyeta nka kristalo, niguruga omu kitebe kya Ruhanga eky'obukama n'eky'Omwana gw'entaama, <verse eid="REV 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 22:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 47:12">Ezk 47:12</ref>. </char></note> niguraba ahagati y'enguuto y'orwo rurembo; seeri na seenu y'ogwo mugyera hariyo omuti gw'amagara ogwana ebyana by'emiringo ikumi n'ebiri, nigwana buri kwezi, kandi amababi gaagwo gari ag'okutambira amahanga. <verse eid="REV 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 22:3" />Tiharibayo mukyeeno obundi, ekitebe kya Ruhanga eky'obukama n'eky'Omwana gw'entaama nibyo biriba omuri orwo rurembo, <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Omu Rugriika n'abahuuku. </char></note>n'abaheereza be baryamuramya; <verse eid="REV 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 22:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:8">Mat 5:8</ref>; <ref loc="REV 3:12">Kush 3:12</ref>. </char></note> baryareeba amaisho ge, n'eiziina rye riryahandiikwa aha buso bwabo. <verse eid="REV 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 22:5" />Tiburigaruka kwira, kandi tibaryetenga kwakirwa tabaaza n'obu ryakuba eizooba, ahakuba Mukama Ruhanga aryaba omushana gwabo, kandi baryategyeka ebiro n'ebiro. <verse eid="REV 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 22:6" />Kandi yangira ati: Ebigambo ebi n'eby'okwesiga kandi eby'amazima. Mukama Ruhanga w'emyoyo ya baanabi akatuma maraika we kworeka abaheereza be ebishemereire kubaho juba. <verse eid="REV 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 22:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 1:3">Kush 1:3</ref>. </char></note> Reeba, niinyija juba. Aine omugisha orikuta omutima aha bigambo by'obunabi eby'omu kitabo eki.<verse eid="REV 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 22:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 19:10">Kush 19:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nyowe Yohaana niinye naahuriire ebi, kandi nkabireeba. Ku naabihuriire, naabireeba, naagwa ahansi aha bigyere bya maraika owaabinyorekire kumuramya; <verse eid="REV 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 22:9" />kwonka yangira ati: Reka! Otakikora; ndi omuheereza mugyenzi waawe n'owa beene sho baanabi, hamwe n'abo abata omutima aha bigambo by'omu kitabo eki. Ramya Ruhanga. <verse eid="REV 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 22:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 10:4">Kush 10:4</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 12:4">Dan 12:4</ref>. </char></note> Kandi yangira ati: Otakoma ebigambo by'obunabi eby'omu kitabo eki n'akamanyiso, ahakuba obunaku buri haihi. <verse eid="REV 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 22:11" />K'enkozi y'ebibi egume ebikore; osiisikaire agume ari osiisikaire; ohikiriire agume akore eby'okuhikiirira; orikwera agume ari orikwera.<verse eid="REV 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 22:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 2:6">Rom 2:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reeba, niinyija juba n'ebihembo byangye kuzimuurira omuntu weena nk'ebi yaakozire oku biri. <verse eid="REV 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 22:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 13:8">Heb 13:8</ref>. </char></note> Niinye Alufa na Omega, ow'okubanza kandi ow'aha muheru, obutandikiro kandi obugarukiro. <verse eid="REV 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 22:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:9">Kut 2:9</ref>. </char></note> Baine omugisha abarikwozya ebijwaro byabo, ngu babone kwikirizibwa kurya aha muti gw'amagara, kandi bataahe omu rurembo nibaraba omu marembo. <verse eid="REV 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 22:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 21:27">Kush 21:27</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 6:9">1 Kor 6:9</ref>, <ref loc="1CO 6:10">10</ref>. </char></note> Aheeru hariyo embwa, abarogi, abashambani, n'abarikuramya ebishushani, kandi n'omuntu weena okunda ebishuba akabikora.<verse eid="REV 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 22:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 11:1">Isa 11:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:78">Luk 1:78</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nyowe Yesu mbatumireho maraika wangye kumanyisa amakanisa ebigambo ebi. Niinye kitsitsa kya Daudi, kandi omwijukuru, Enyonyoozi y'omu kasheeshe erikumurinkana.<verse eid="REV 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 22:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 55:1">Isa 55:1</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 7:37">Yoh 7:37</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omwoyo n'Omugore nibagira bati: Ija! Orikuhurira agire ati: Ija! Oine eiriho aije; kandi weena orikwenda atwarire busha amaizi g'amagara.<verse eid="REV 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 22:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 4:2">Bir 4:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Niinyehanangiriza omuntu weena orikuhurira ebigambo by'omu kitabo eki, nti: Omuntu weena ku aribyongyeraho, Ruhanga aryamwongyeraho ebibonaboneso ebihandiikirwe omu kitabo eki; <verse eid="REV 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 22:19" />kandi omuntu weena ku aricwa aha bigambo eby'omu kitabo ky'obunabi obu, Ruhanga aryamwaka omugabo gwe ogw'aha muti gw'amagara n'ogw'omu rurembo orurikwera, ebihandiikirwe omu kitabo eki. <verse eid="REV 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 22:20" />Orikuhamya ebi naagira ati: Buzimazima niinyija juba. Amiina. Ija, Mukama waitu Yesu.<verse eid="REV 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 22:21" />Embabazi za Mukama waitu Yesu zigume n'abarikwera boona. Amiina.<verse eid="REV 22:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 22" />
</usx>